(3111073, 436811, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful portrait of this little big, eyed puppy. Whenever they cock their head to the side in curiosity it adds instant appeal to the picture. You captured a great pose and the lighting is excellent. Ginger''s portrait screams "cuteness" all over it. Good job!</td>', 'What a wonderful portrait of this little big, eyed puppy. Whenever they cock their head to the side in curiosity it adds instant appeal to the picture. You captured a great pose and the lighting is excellent. Ginger''s portrait screams "cuteness" all over it. Good job!', '2006-12-13 00:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
