(3112038, 438049, 16402, '<td valign="top">Portraits work much better when the face, not the $#@*, is toward the camera. Probably should have tried to get the dog to turn around.</td>', 'Portraits work much better when the face, not the $#@*, is toward the camera. Probably should have tried to get the dog to turn around.', '2006-12-13 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
