(3112044, 435497, 67152, '<td valign="top">the focus is too soft for my taste - I would recommend some sharpening using USM -  and I would have cropped it to get the seam of the black backgroun out of the picture - great puppies though!</td>', 'the focus is too soft for my taste - I would recommend some sharpening using USM -  and I would have cropped it to get the seam of the black backgroun out of the picture - great puppies though!', '2006-12-13 07:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
