(3112048, 437850, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the image (and miss my husky that passed away last year). How did you get yours to stand in one place with all that snow around!  The only thing taking this down a notch is the shadow on the face - i would have loved to see those great ears illuminated better</td>', 'i love the image (and miss my husky that passed away last year). How did you get yours to stand in one place with all that snow around!  The only thing taking this down a notch is the shadow on the face - i would have loved to see those great ears illuminated better', '2006-12-13 07:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
