(3112240, 437992, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great dog.  The harsh lighting brings out too much of the green carpet and shair and does not highlight the dog.  I would recommend cropping the photo to highlight the great eyes and try to use natural light instead of a flash - for example try to get a picture with the dog outside</td>', 'Great dog.  The harsh lighting brings out too much of the green carpet and shair and does not highlight the dog.  I would recommend cropping the photo to highlight the great eyes and try to use natural light instead of a flash - for example try to get a picture with the dog outside', '2006-12-13 08:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
