(3113377, 438070, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the cute expression and the off side profile view of this dog. The dog and especially the color of the red sweater really pops off visually from the black background. But I think there is too much negative space included in the shot. A tighter crop to just on the dog itself would keep the focus squarely on the dog.</td>', 'Love the cute expression and the off side profile view of this dog. The dog and especially the color of the red sweater really pops off visually from the black background. But I think there is too much negative space included in the shot. A tighter crop to just on the dog itself would keep the focus squarely on the dog.', '2006-12-13 13:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
