(3113748, 437497, 68947, '<td valign="top">wow, now there''s an expression! *smile*  Love the title.  Seems to match the mood well.  I don''t know whether you have any editing programs, but if you do, I''d have tried to select, copy and paste this furbaby onto a new layer so that you could have blurred the background quite a bit more to make the focus the face and perhaps, cropped out a bit more of the right hand side of the background area.  But, I can SO relate to this baby''s expression! *smile*</td>', 'wow, now there''s an expression! *smile*  Love the title.  Seems to match the mood well.  I don''t know whether you have any editing programs, but if you do, I''d have tried to select, copy and paste this furbaby onto a new layer so that you could have blurred the background quite a bit more to make the focus the face and perhaps, cropped out a bit more of the right hand side of the background area.  But, I can SO relate to this baby''s expression! *smile*', '2006-12-13 14:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
