(3114128, 437663, 68947, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Cover Shot! I''m just going to say here.......I''m glad it''s not ME that has to brush out that fur! *grin*  Strike A Pose!</td>', 'Looks like a Cover Shot! I''m just going to say here.......I''m glad it''s not ME that has to brush out that fur! *grin*  Strike A Pose!', '2006-12-13 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
