(3114135, 437639, 68947, '<td valign="top">oooooo........nice lighting, background and pose!!!  How on earth did you get that shot?  It''s hard enough to set it all up properly let alone get them to actually stay there AND.......get that pose!!!!!!!!  Great shot!!!</td>', 'oooooo........nice lighting, background and pose!!!  How on earth did you get that shot?  It''s hard enough to set it all up properly let alone get them to actually stay there AND.......get that pose!!!!!!!!  Great shot!!!', '2006-12-13 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
