(3114144, 437896, 68947, '<td valign="top">love the composition!  Gorgeous eyes and face!  Too bad the focus wasn''t a bit better.  Bet either kitty moved, you moved or the exposure time was a bit too long????  I really like the mood that you captured in this shot though.</td>', 'love the composition!  Gorgeous eyes and face!  Too bad the focus wasn''t a bit better.  Bet either kitty moved, you moved or the exposure time was a bit too long????  I really like the mood that you captured in this shot though.', '2006-12-13 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
