(3115084, 438053, 43463, '<td valign="top">I can make out very few details of the face. I can barely see the nose, there is no eye (I am going to assume that this is a sleeping cat) and the head is vaguely outlined by the sheen of the hairs picking up the lighting. Mayhap it might be that the monitor calibration is the culprit or upping the gamma or brightness &amp; contrast might help the cat be more visible. Having a black cat on a black background is very challenging because you don''t have contrasting colors. Thus lighting becomes very important. Mayhap you needed a stronger light or another light to illuminate the left half of the cat''s face seen here so that the viewer could greater appreciate the features of this sleeping cat.</td>', 'I can make out very few details of the face. I can barely see the nose, there is no eye (I am going to assume that this is a sleeping cat) and the head is vaguely outlined by the sheen of the hairs picking up the lighting. Mayhap it might be that the monitor calibration is the culprit or upping the gamma or brightness & contrast might help the cat be more visible. Having a black cat on a black background is very challenging because you don''t have contrasting colors. Thus lighting becomes very important. Mayhap you needed a stronger light or another light to illuminate the left half of the cat''s face seen here so that the viewer could greater appreciate the features of this sleeping cat.', '2006-12-13 20:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115086, 437757, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great timing on this shot to capture the expression. The title is quite funny to go along with it too. The focus looks good and I really like the composition. I like the soft lighting. There is some noticable grain, though it isn''t too detrimental.</td>', 'Great timing on this shot to capture the expression. The title is quite funny to go along with it too. The focus looks good and I really like the composition. I like the soft lighting. There is some noticable grain, though it isn''t too detrimental.', '2006-12-13 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115088, 436351, 13119, '<td valign="top">might work better if you can see the whole face</td>', 'might work better if you can see the whole face', '2006-12-13 20:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115089, 437638, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great composition and exposure. I like the gaze moving through the image to help balance the offcenter composition.</td>', 'Great composition and exposure. I like the gaze moving through the image to help balance the offcenter composition.', '2006-12-13 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115091, 437981, 13119, '<td valign="top">seems a little blurry</td>', 'seems a little blurry', '2006-12-13 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115094, 435443, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot.  I love the autumn leaves on the ground for their extra color, and I like the direct stare into the camera. Very cute kitty. Great DOF to give a sense of the environment, but not in focus enough to draw attention from the subject.</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot.  I love the autumn leaves on the ground for their extra color, and I like the direct stare into the camera. Very cute kitty. Great DOF to give a sense of the environment, but not in focus enough to draw attention from the subject.', '2006-12-13 20:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
