(3115119, 435637, 27767, '<td valign="top">This shot is so cute.  I love the bright brown eyes. The composition is good as well as the focus.</td>', 'This shot is so cute.  I love the bright brown eyes. The composition is good as well as the focus.', '2006-12-13 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115121, 436797, 55642, '<td valign="top">The border really detracts. All you needed, if you absolutely must have one, is a thin black line.</td>', 'The border really detracts. All you needed, if you absolutely must have one, is a thin black line.', '2006-12-13 20:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115127, 435625, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very cute puppy. I like how you keep your set-up simple and clean. The rust red background works well with the greyish/brown tones of the dog. The white fur ''bed'' it rests on offers a nice soft place for the puppy to rest not to mention it projects a subtle feel of softness to the viewer; the puppy and the fur are soft to touch if you just reach out. Lighting is great. There are no harsh shadows and we get to see every lovely detail in this pet portrait. The expression of the puppy also adds visual interest. With a cock of the head a dog/puppy seems to be studying us the viewer in curiosity. Great capture.</td>', 'Very cute puppy. I like how you keep your set-up simple and clean. The rust red background works well with the greyish/brown tones of the dog. The white fur ''bed'' it rests on offers a nice soft place for the puppy to rest not to mention it projects a subtle feel of softness to the viewer; the puppy and the fur are soft to touch if you just reach out. Lighting is great. There are no harsh shadows and we get to see every lovely detail in this pet portrait. The expression of the puppy also adds visual interest. With a cock of the head a dog/puppy seems to be studying us the viewer in curiosity. Great capture.', '2006-12-13 20:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115132, 437814, 27767, '<td valign="top">Adorable lab! I like this composition and focus; just off-center enough to avoid being too static. The catchlights in the dog''s eyes are good and the overall exposure is as well. Only suggestion would be to sharpen it just a little bit to pull out a little more detail.</td>', 'Adorable lab! I like this composition and focus; just off-center enough to avoid being too static. The catchlights in the dog''s eyes are good and the overall exposure is as well. Only suggestion would be to sharpen it just a little bit to pull out a little more detail.', '2006-12-13 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115135, 435355, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that they''re all looking the same direction... I mean, three out of four is even quite impressive!</td>', 'I''m amazed that they''re all looking the same direction... I mean, three out of four is even quite impressive!', '2006-12-13 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115136, 436946, 63960, '<td valign="top">Only cats are supposed to end up this way... cute shot!</td>', 'Only cats are supposed to end up this way... cute shot!', '2006-12-13 20:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115141, 438091, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The lighting looks good and the overall focus is too. I think that having the line of sight more toward the camera could engage the viewer a little more, but it''s not bad.</td>', 'Great portrait. The lighting looks good and the overall focus is too. I think that having the line of sight more toward the camera could engage the viewer a little more, but it''s not bad.', '2006-12-13 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115146, 436444, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  I think the background works very well with this model, and I love the positioning on the pedestal. The catchlights in the eyes are great, and the exposure is quite good (maybe bordering on blown out in a few spots). Great composition of dog and pedestal in the frame.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  I think the background works very well with this model, and I love the positioning on the pedestal. The catchlights in the eyes are great, and the exposure is quite good (maybe bordering on blown out in a few spots). Great composition of dog and pedestal in the frame.', '2006-12-13 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115151, 436222, 27767, '<td valign="top">I love this close up composition. The focus is good, though if there was sharpening done, it might be just a touch too much, loosing the soft/fuzzy feel. Good selective desaturation.</td>', 'I love this close up composition. The focus is good, though if there was sharpening done, it might be just a touch too much, loosing the soft/fuzzy feel. Good selective desaturation.', '2006-12-13 20:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
