(3115756, 437991, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.I love this but that blob of grass in the lower left hurts it. I think you could crop it out and create a more square photo, and it''d still be ok.  What a beauty. 7</td>', 'Wonderful.I love this but that blob of grass in the lower left hurts it. I think you could crop it out and create a more square photo, and it''d still be ok.  What a beauty. 7', '2006-12-13 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
