(3116195, 436695, 32872, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like a sheltie dog I had years ago.  Her name was Dallas, the smartest dog I''ve ever owned.  I could teach her a trick within 3 mintues!  She loved to perform and had a heart of gold.  This tugs at my heart strings!  Nice image.</td>', 'This looks so much like a sheltie dog I had years ago.  Her name was Dallas, the smartest dog I''ve ever owned.  I could teach her a trick within 3 mintues!  She loved to perform and had a heart of gold.  This tugs at my heart strings!  Nice image.', '2006-12-14 03:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
