(3116307, 437884, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful cat! cute picture!</td>', 'wow, beautiful cat! cute picture!', '2006-12-14 05:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116308, 436927, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, looks like contact lenses...;-)</td>', 'wow, looks like contact lenses...;-)', '2006-12-14 05:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116309, 437260, 39825, '<td valign="top">oooooooooh....love cats! how can anybody NOT love them?!</td>', 'oooooooooh....love cats! how can anybody NOT love them?!', '2006-12-14 05:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116312, 437775, 39825, '<td valign="top">great colours!</td>', 'great colours!', '2006-12-14 05:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116313, 436099, 39825, '<td valign="top">*lol* very funny dog! 9 points!</td>', '*lol* very funny dog! 9 points!', '2006-12-14 05:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116320, 438017, 22689, '<td valign="top">I love cats , I can''t imagine my life without them and grey ones have something special.<br/>This one is simply fantastic , relaxed but with the eyes opened to see what''s happening around him/her.<br/>What I like in this photo : of course the pose , the focus , the cushion (or blanket) that gives contrast because of its color and adds a diagonal element and the way you have used lights and shadows.<br/>Very nice !</td>', 'I love cats , I can''t imagine my life without them and grey ones have something special.This one is simply fantastic , relaxed but with the eyes opened to see what''s happening around him/her.What I like in this photo : of course the pose , the focus , the cushion (or blanket) that gives contrast because of its color and adds a diagonal element and the way you have used lights and shadows.Very nice !', '2006-12-14 05:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116321, 437225, 39825, '<td valign="top">oh this cat is SO cute!!! love the title and the picture! could have been a little bit sharper though, so 9. ;-)</td>', 'oh this cat is SO cute!!! love the title and the picture! could have been a little bit sharper though, so 9. ;-)', '2006-12-14 05:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116323, 436034, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful horse, as beautiful as the picture! go for a ribbon!!!</td>', 'wow, beautiful horse, as beautiful as the picture! go for a ribbon!!!', '2006-12-14 05:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116324, 436924, 39825, '<td valign="top">*lol* how funny is this!!!! cool. *g* 10 points!</td>', '*lol* how funny is this!!!! cool. *g* 10 points!', '2006-12-14 05:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116325, 436222, 22689, '<td valign="top">Royal is an adjective that fits her very well !<br/>I feel something special for grey cats , this one is so lovely.</td>', 'Royal is an adjective that fits her very well !I feel something special for grey cats , this one is so lovely.', '2006-12-14 05:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116326, 436234, 39825, '<td valign="top">*ggg* cute!</td>', '*ggg* cute!', '2006-12-14 05:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116328, 437954, 43565, '<td valign="top">Might be a bit too bright, but he''s too cute for anything less than a 7 from me!  (And to anyone reading this after the challenge, I really gave it a 7 because of the detail present and it is a portrait--and the fact that I think the dog is cute probably bumped it up from a 6.)</td>', 'Might be a bit too bright, but he''s too cute for anything less than a 7 from me!  (And to anyone reading this after the challenge, I really gave it a 7 because of the detail present and it is a portrait--and the fact that I think the dog is cute probably bumped it up from a 6.)', '2006-12-14 05:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116330, 437629, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish I could really see the left eye.</td>', 'I wish I could really see the left eye.', '2006-12-14 05:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116331, 438080, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better without the child included.</td>', 'I would have liked this better without the child included.', '2006-12-14 05:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116336, 436240, 53147, '<td valign="top">Does he meow? Great entry. Nice to see people use something other than the normal models. Nice detail and DOF. The color cast feels a bit strong but I like the shot none the less. 7 fo rnow.</td>', 'Does he meow? Great entry. Nice to see people use something other than the normal models. Nice detail and DOF. The color cast feels a bit strong but I like the shot none the less. 7 fo rnow.', '2006-12-14 05:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116337, 437641, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, a portrait includes controlling the lighting and setting, and I should be able to see the subject''s face.  The fire hydrant could work, but wait until the sun is not so harsh.  The fence doesn''t add anything, and I can''t see the dog''s face.  When I look at this shot, the first thing I see is the hydrant, then the shadow, then the dog.</td>', 'To me, a portrait includes controlling the lighting and setting, and I should be able to see the subject''s face.  The fire hydrant could work, but wait until the sun is not so harsh.  The fence doesn''t add anything, and I can''t see the dog''s face.  When I look at this shot, the first thing I see is the hydrant, then the shadow, then the dog.', '2006-12-14 05:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116340, 437583, 43565, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems harsh and I would like to see the eyes.</td>', 'The lighting seems harsh and I would like to see the eyes.', '2006-12-14 05:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116341, 437813, 43565, '<td valign="top">This dog is glowing yellow.  Gives a radioactive look.</td>', 'This dog is glowing yellow.  Gives a radioactive look.', '2006-12-14 05:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116342, 438083, 43565, '<td valign="top">The angle of the head doesn''t work for me.  Maybe if the nose were not cut off it would help, but there is something about where the head joins the neck that looks strange.</td>', 'The angle of the head doesn''t work for me.  Maybe if the nose were not cut off it would help, but there is something about where the head joins the neck that looks strange.', '2006-12-14 05:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116344, 438067, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like to be able to see her eyes.</td>', 'I would like to be able to see her eyes.', '2006-12-14 05:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116345, 435760, 43565, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too bright and the focus seems a little off to me.</td>', 'The lighting is too bright and the focus seems a little off to me.', '2006-12-14 05:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116346, 437668, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail, however I expect to see a face included in a portrait.</td>', 'Great focus and detail, however I expect to see a face included in a portrait.', '2006-12-14 05:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116347, 436017, 43565, '<td valign="top">This seems more like a snapshot and not a portrait.  To me, a portrait is about control--the pose, the lighting and the background.  Grass would work fine for the background, but this pose does not work for me.</td>', 'This seems more like a snapshot and not a portrait.  To me, a portrait is about control--the pose, the lighting and the background.  Grass would work fine for the background, but this pose does not work for me.', '2006-12-14 05:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116348, 435663, 43565, '<td valign="top">Lovely wings, but is this a pet?</td>', 'Lovely wings, but is this a pet?', '2006-12-14 05:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116349, 438049, 43565, '<td valign="top">For me, a portrait should include the face.</td>', 'For me, a portrait should include the face.', '2006-12-14 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116350, 438058, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, a portrait is about control--of the background, lighting and pose.  Including a toy is fine, but the focus should still be on the pet.  The light seems to be aimed at the toy making it seem more like the subject, and while I can see the dog''s eyes, his ears are lost in the shadows.  While the background is dark, I can still see it is a room in your house.</td>', 'To me, a portrait is about control--of the background, lighting and pose.  Including a toy is fine, but the focus should still be on the pet.  The light seems to be aimed at the toy making it seem more like the subject, and while I can see the dog''s eyes, his ears are lost in the shadows.  While the background is dark, I can still see it is a room in your house.', '2006-12-14 06:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116353, 435810, 41337, '<td valign="top">Classic portrait.</td>', 'Classic portrait.', '2006-12-14 06:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116359, 437639, 46570, '<td valign="top">Your title goes perfectly with this beauty''s face. I would personally perfer a little more lighting. 8</td>', 'Your title goes perfectly with this beauty''s face. I would personally perfer a little more lighting. 8', '2006-12-14 06:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116392, 437760, 53147, '<td valign="top">Striking image. Lovely colors and excellent detail. The water droplets on his whiskers ar ecool. Bumpin gup to an 8.</td>', 'Striking image. Lovely colors and excellent detail. The water droplets on his whiskers ar ecool. Bumpin gup to an 8.', '2006-12-14 07:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116394, 438053, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really like images like this. While maybe not a ribbon winner in this challenge it is still strong. Bumping up to 8 and adding to my faves.</td>', 'I really like images like this. While maybe not a ribbon winner in this challenge it is still strong. Bumping up to 8 and adding to my faves.', '2006-12-14 07:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116398, 436795, 53147, '<td valign="top">Wow - if the eyes are really that color then you have one wild looking cat. If they arent then I think the color shift may have been a bit too much. You have such great colors and patterns going on in the fur that the eyes just seem a bit out of place. The strength in this image (IMHO) is in the clarity and vibrant color overall rather than making the color of her eyes the focus. They are sharp and detailed and I think if they were s softer color you would have had a better overall package. Beautiful cat though. 7</td>', 'Wow - if the eyes are really that color then you have one wild looking cat. If they arent then I think the color shift may have been a bit too much. You have such great colors and patterns going on in the fur that the eyes just seem a bit out of place. The strength in this image (IMHO) is in the clarity and vibrant color overall rather than making the color of her eyes the focus. They are sharp and detailed and I think if they were s softer color you would have had a better overall package. Beautiful cat though. 7', '2006-12-14 07:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116400, 437456, 53147, '<td valign="top">Your model really suits the soft editing treatent that you have given. While maybe not a knockout picture it has a great feel to it and is a pleasure to view (and its not a stinky dog). 7</td>', 'Your model really suits the soft editing treatent that you have given. While maybe not a knockout picture it has a great feel to it and is a pleasure to view (and its not a stinky dog). 7', '2006-12-14 07:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116401, 438032, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. Maybe cropped a bit too tight on the top - I like seeing the whole head ears and all. Excellent use of natural lighting and really just an overall pleasing picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture. Maybe cropped a bit too tight on the top - I like seeing the whole head ears and all. Excellent use of natural lighting and really just an overall pleasing picture.', '2006-12-14 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116417, 438080, 53200, '<td valign="top">The thing I love about this is that both the child and puppy look like they are equally soft to the touch.</td>', 'The thing I love about this is that both the child and puppy look like they are equally soft to the touch.', '2006-12-14 07:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
