(3116592, 436431, 43463, '<td valign="top">A very cute and humorous photo. I could tell you put a lot of effort into composing the shot with the right elements from the jingle bells on the doggie''s hat to the toys by the tree, the poinsetta and the chimney...<br/>Only thing is - I don''t think Santa will want to come down the chimney with the fire lit;-) <br/>Lighting is good but there seems to be a slight, and I say slight, yellowish cast to the image. Playing around with selective desat could help remove that color cast. Overall a creative and cute composition.</td>', 'A very cute and humorous photo. I could tell you put a lot of effort into composing the shot with the right elements from the jingle bells on the doggie''s hat to the toys by the tree, the poinsetta and the chimney...Only thing is - I don''t think Santa will want to come down the chimney with the fire lit;-) Lighting is good but there seems to be a slight, and I say slight, yellowish cast to the image. Playing around with selective desat could help remove that color cast. Overall a creative and cute composition.', '2006-12-14 08:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116597, 436034, 69589, '<td valign="top">Great texture! A 3/4 angle on the horse would add some more drama with the wind and mane, supporting your title. Also, a looser crop would give the subject some more visual breathing room. Definate "feed me face" : )</td>', 'Great texture! A 3/4 angle on the horse would add some more drama with the wind and mane, supporting your title. Also, a looser crop would give the subject some more visual breathing room. Definate "feed me face" : )', '2006-12-14 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
