(3116645, 437572, 15711, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to look at this wonderful face.  You did the detail and focus perfectly.  Great expression and symmetry. What delicious markings. The eyes are awesome. Bumping up!</td>', 'I keep coming back to look at this wonderful face.  You did the detail and focus perfectly.  Great expression and symmetry. What delicious markings. The eyes are awesome. Bumping up!', '2006-12-14 09:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116646, 436503, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the diagonal tilt of his/her head.  Good detail of the whiskers.  Beautiful eyes.  Wonder what thoughts are going through that head! 7</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the diagonal tilt of his/her head.  Good detail of the whiskers.  Beautiful eyes.  Wonder what thoughts are going through that head! 7', '2006-12-14 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116649, 436165, 15711, '<td valign="top">This almost isn''t a portrait but I love it anyway.  Great use of color and negative space. The dog is almost a little afterthought in the upper right hand corner.  Nice image! 7</td>', 'This almost isn''t a portrait but I love it anyway.  Great use of color and negative space. The dog is almost a little afterthought in the upper right hand corner.  Nice image! 7', '2006-12-14 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
