(3116936, 437019, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you caught a halfway decent pose but the red spot on the bottom and the small pic size are two things that are hurting you here. The dark shadow on the back eye feels odd as well. i dont know if you burned it that dark but it gives a feeling that the eye is not even there and its just a hole.</td>', 'I think you caught a halfway decent pose but the red spot on the bottom and the small pic size are two things that are hurting you here. The dark shadow on the back eye feels odd as well. i dont know if you burned it that dark but it gives a feeling that the eye is not even there and its just a hole.', '2006-12-14 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116938, 437963, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cute puppy for sure but it has a snapshot feel rather than a proper portrait. Good focus and detail but I dont think that will carry it far.</td>', 'Cute puppy for sure but it has a snapshot feel rather than a proper portrait. Good focus and detail but I dont think that will carry it far.', '2006-12-14 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116940, 438110, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit soft on the focus and the background is a bit distracting. This shot doesnt grab me.</td>', 'A bit soft on the focus and the background is a bit distracting. This shot doesnt grab me.', '2006-12-14 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116946, 437811, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice looking cat. Unfortunately the softness in focus and the muted colors arent working for me. Takes away from the deep color that I am sure this kitty is. The lighting contrast between the eyes feels a bit uch as well but maybe just because of the color over the one and lack of color on the other.</td>', 'Nice looking cat. Unfortunately the softness in focus and the muted colors arent working for me. Takes away from the deep color that I am sure this kitty is. The lighting contrast between the eyes feels a bit uch as well but maybe just because of the color over the one and lack of color on the other.', '2006-12-14 11:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116950, 436804, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject matter. I guess some interest as a macro - but in  a portrait challenge it doesnt really speak to me.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject matter. I guess some interest as a macro - but in  a portrait challenge it doesnt really speak to me.', '2006-12-14 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
