(3117589, 435443, 62318, '<td valign="top">This photo is great because of the post processing. The colors really pop. However, when one starts to post process you must watch out for taking it too far in some areas. This is one where the eyes are just too sharp for this resolution. I give points for the post for the colors, yet take the same points away for the oversharpened eyes. I give it the same score even if there was no post, a high 7. If the eyes weren''t overdone, it would have probably been my favorite with a 8 or 9. Great photo overall, highly recommended. Marking as a favorite for the whole concept and to give me ideas in the future.</td>', 'This photo is great because of the post processing. The colors really pop. However, when one starts to post process you must watch out for taking it too far in some areas. This is one where the eyes are just too sharp for this resolution. I give points for the post for the colors, yet take the same points away for the oversharpened eyes. I give it the same score even if there was no post, a high 7. If the eyes weren''t overdone, it would have probably been my favorite with a 8 or 9. Great photo overall, highly recommended. Marking as a favorite for the whole concept and to give me ideas in the future.', '2006-12-14 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
