(3117939, 437472, 62318, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo. Captures the spirit of the dog, makes me chuckle, and is very unique. Wonderful picture. Not much I would change. I think there might be a hair on the lens or sensor between the eyes, but that really doesn''t take away from the photo. A rare 10 from me.</td>', 'My favorite photo. Captures the spirit of the dog, makes me chuckle, and is very unique. Wonderful picture. Not much I would change. I think there might be a hair on the lens or sensor between the eyes, but that really doesn''t take away from the photo. A rare 10 from me.', '2006-12-14 17:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117940, 435983, 62318, '<td valign="top">Great colors and interesting subject. One of my favorites in the challenge. Probably would have received the highest rating if the whole subject was in focus. Highly rated.</td>', 'Great colors and interesting subject. One of my favorites in the challenge. Probably would have received the highest rating if the whole subject was in focus. Highly rated.', '2006-12-14 17:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
