(3119848, 437460, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice portrait of Riot.  Good use of selective desat with his colors.  Like to have seen that emphasized somehow, somewhere, even perhaps with a matching frame to his eye color.  Variation in framing too, with perhaps a little less space on the left, not sure.  Nice ''candid'' capture.</td>', '6 - Nice portrait of Riot.  Good use of selective desat with his colors.  Like to have seen that emphasized somehow, somewhere, even perhaps with a matching frame to his eye color.  Variation in framing too, with perhaps a little less space on the left, not sure.  Nice ''candid'' capture.', '2006-12-15 05:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119849, 435983, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice textures and color.  Think for this Challenge a more creative take may have given this more of a portrait feel.  The arm/hand(?) bottom right is slighty distracting, especially for a portrait.  Variation in composition likely have helped this too in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice textures and color.  Think for this Challenge a more creative take may have given this more of a portrait feel.  The arm/hand(?) bottom right is slighty distracting, especially for a portrait.  Variation in composition likely have helped this too in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 06:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119852, 437545, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t get the title, unless it is something to do with the Christmas tree.  Colors/saturation look a little odd, difficult fur to capture I imagine - could be some slight blur though, not sure.  More refined crop would have helped this in my opinion.  Because the collar is not fully visible, it is slightly distracting.</td>', '4 - Don''t get the title, unless it is something to do with the Christmas tree.  Colors/saturation look a little odd, difficult fur to capture I imagine - could be some slight blur though, not sure.  More refined crop would have helped this in my opinion.  Because the collar is not fully visible, it is slightly distracting.', '2006-12-15 06:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119853, 437987, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice pink nose.  Image (including nose) looks over neat imaged (apologies if wrong), exaggerating the blown white areas and of course, losing the texture.  Having said that, the ''feel'' to the shot because of the processing, makes it quite unique.  Variation in framing, as well as softer lighting, may have made this better in my opinion.  The pupils look like there are flash / something issues in them.</td>', '4 - Nice pink nose.  Image (including nose) looks over neat imaged (apologies if wrong), exaggerating the blown white areas and of course, losing the texture.  Having said that, the ''feel'' to the shot because of the processing, makes it quite unique.  Variation in framing, as well as softer lighting, may have made this better in my opinion.  The pupils look like there are flash / something issues in them.', '2006-12-15 06:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119854, 437578, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Poor Mac.  He looks somewhat insulted.  Variation in the background to ''take full advantage'' of this set up, including the colors, may have given this an edge.  Minor, but seems to be an ''issue'' (white spot) behind Mac''s head to the left of frame.  Some sensor dust / something to the left of that too.</td>', '6 - Poor Mac.  He looks somewhat insulted.  Variation in the background to ''take full advantage'' of this set up, including the colors, may have given this an edge.  Minor, but seems to be an ''issue'' (white spot) behind Mac''s head to the left of frame.  Some sensor dust / something to the left of that too.', '2006-12-15 06:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119855, 438013, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice setting and colors.  Wish Tanner were not chopped in half.  A variation in perspective/angle, likely have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Nice setting and colors.  Wish Tanner were not chopped in half.  A variation in perspective/angle, likely have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 06:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119856, 437809, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice lighting, just wish the left side was not so dark and dominant.  A little more height in the frame too.  The softness is nice, but better placement of ''key'' focal areas within the frame make this even better in my opinion.  Like the angle.</td>', '6 - Very nice lighting, just wish the left side was not so dark and dominant.  A little more height in the frame too.  The softness is nice, but better placement of ''key'' focal areas within the frame make this even better in my opinion.  Like the angle.', '2006-12-15 06:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119857, 437879, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Different.  Like the colors.  Not sure the best ''pose'' for a Portrait Challenge.</td>', '3 - Different.  Like the colors.  Not sure the best ''pose'' for a Portrait Challenge.', '2006-12-15 06:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119858, 437812, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice shot and good potential.  The reds just jump out first and dominate too much in my opinion.  The lighting on the puppy''s nose just a fraction too harsh.  Like to have seen the pup dominate the frame more.</td>', '5 - Nice shot and good potential.  The reds just jump out first and dominate too much in my opinion.  The lighting on the puppy''s nose just a fraction too harsh.  Like to have seen the pup dominate the frame more.', '2006-12-15 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119860, 437613, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential, think I understand the concept, not sure you''ve achieved it though.  Seems to be blur issues, but could be intentional.  Bigger (640 height) make this better in my opinion - if the quality was there.</td>', '4 - Good potential, think I understand the concept, not sure you''ve achieved it though.  Seems to be blur issues, but could be intentional.  Bigger (640 height) make this better in my opinion - if the quality was there.', '2006-12-15 06:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119861, 438049, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A bit more face included would have been better, nice colors.</td>', '3 - A bit more face included would have been better, nice colors.', '2006-12-15 06:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119863, 437781, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - You''ve captured his beauty well, especially with the range of colors and your control of them.  Obviously you''ve opted for the ear chop, undecided on it, but does work as is anyway in my opinion.  The background color complements this / him well.  Just like to have seen the eyes a little more, ''somehow''.</td>', '7 - You''ve captured his beauty well, especially with the range of colors and your control of them.  Obviously you''ve opted for the ear chop, undecided on it, but does work as is anyway in my opinion.  The background color complements this / him well.  Just like to have seen the eyes a little more, ''somehow''.', '2006-12-15 06:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119864, 436630, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Quite a good ''studio portrait'' of Boris, however in my opinion the background is a little ''bland'' and the pose perhaps a little.. ''uninteresting''.  The darker areas seem to need attention too.</td>', '5 - Quite a good ''studio portrait'' of Boris, however in my opinion the background is a little ''bland'' and the pose perhaps a little.. ''uninteresting''.  The darker areas seem to need attention too.', '2006-12-15 06:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119865, 437679, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not enough ''cat'' in my opinion to make this more of a portrait than an abstract.  Additionally, this close up of the eye.. if the eye was clean make it even better.</td>', '3 - Not enough ''cat'' in my opinion to make this more of a portrait than an abstract.  Additionally, this close up of the eye.. if the eye was clean make it even better.', '2006-12-15 06:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119869, 437316, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice clarity in that eye.  Nice colors.  The wood shavings(?) are slightly distracting. Like to have seen his/her leg not choppped else a little tighter and just a <i>fraction</i> more dof with the shell.</td>', '6 - Nice clarity in that eye.  Nice colors.  The wood shavings(?) are slightly distracting. Like to have seen his/her leg not choppped else a little tighter and just a fraction more dof with the shell.', '2006-12-15 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119870, 438034, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - What a nice portrait and capture.  Just wish the nose was in focus too, or else the eyes dominating a little more.  Nice composition and colors.  Maybe just a fraction less wood on the left, but very minor.  Like the title.</td>', '8 - What a nice portrait and capture.  Just wish the nose was in focus too, or else the eyes dominating a little more.  Nice composition and colors.  Maybe just a fraction less wood on the left, but very minor.  Like the title.', '2006-12-15 06:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119872, 437247, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Not sure the b&amp;w has enhanced this image.  Also the focus seems slightly off.  The reflection in the eye(s) make this a little ''odd'' in my opinion.  Composition is nice, as is the capture/pose.</td>', '4 - Not sure the b&w has enhanced this image.  Also the focus seems slightly off.  The reflection in the eye(s) make this a little ''odd'' in my opinion.  Composition is nice, as is the capture/pose.', '2006-12-15 06:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119874, 438066, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Lighting looks a bit harsh.  Like that you''ve gone for a different color background, but not sure this color choice is well suited to Sammy''s colors.  Because both eyes are not clearly visible, makes one look a little ''odd'', in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Lighting looks a bit harsh.  Like that you''ve gone for a different color background, but not sure this color choice is well suited to Sammy''s colors.  Because both eyes are not clearly visible, makes one look a little ''odd'', in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 06:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119875, 436193, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Just wish Suzi was filling up the frame more and was ''bigger''.  Perhaps the toy Suzi is playing with included too, who knows.  The fore paw.. a <i>little</i> more discernible too.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Just wish Suzi was filling up the frame more and was ''bigger''.  Perhaps the toy Suzi is playing with included too, who knows.  The fore paw.. a little more discernible too.', '2006-12-15 06:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119876, 437171, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks a bit snapshottish, however your title is quite amusing in contrast.  Different background would have helped this.  Looks like some pixelation issues as well.  Frame detracts in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks a bit snapshottish, however your title is quite amusing in contrast.  Different background would have helped this.  Looks like some pixelation issues as well.  Frame detracts in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 06:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
