(3119879, 436378, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Ha.. that''s good.  Nice color capture.. and control.  Just the frame.  Background also has a yellow/green tinge to it, which the frame enhances.  A little more room above Babaji in the frame may have also given this a little more of an edge.</td>', '7 - Ha.. that''s good.  Nice color capture.. and control.  Just the frame.  Background also has a yellow/green tinge to it, which the frame enhances.  A little more room above Babaji in the frame may have also given this a little more of an edge.', '2006-12-15 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
