(3119911, 436173, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice angle and crop and composition.  Nice capture, like the reflection in the eyes too.  Just the .. grain/noise and loss of ''control'', detail in the black - otherwise, very nice portrait.</td>', '6 - Very nice angle and crop and composition.  Nice capture, like the reflection in the eyes too.  Just the .. grain/noise and loss of ''control'', detail in the black - otherwise, very nice portrait.', '2006-12-15 06:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119912, 437696, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice profile ''portrait'' of Jim.  Perhaps some more height in the frame, going for more of a square crop, may have given this an edge.  Difficult, but the lighting the way it is, the white background isn''t enhancing any of Jim''s wonderful colors and textures, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice profile ''portrait'' of Jim.  Perhaps some more height in the frame, going for more of a square crop, may have given this an edge.  Difficult, but the lighting the way it is, the white background isn''t enhancing any of Jim''s wonderful colors and textures, in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 06:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119915, 437968, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks a little snapshottish in my opinion.  Some blur here as well.  A more refined crop and perhaps variation in framing (more horizontal, who knows), make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks a little snapshottish in my opinion.  Some blur here as well.  A more refined crop and perhaps variation in framing (more horizontal, who knows), make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 07:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119918, 437037, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice portrait of Moochie, just a little too tight for this frame/composition choice in my opinion and the ''noise'' has seeped through too much.</td>', '4 - Nice portrait of Moochie, just a little too tight for this frame/composition choice in my opinion and the ''noise'' has seeped through too much.', '2006-12-15 07:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119920, 438019, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Obviously very good, but not as much as a ''portrait'' as I''d like to have seen.. more of a ''moment capture'', which I understand may be your choice for an appropriate portrait here.  Just wish the edge of the cushion was out of frame, but .. difficult.</td>', '7 - Obviously very good, but not as much as a ''portrait'' as I''d like to have seen.. more of a ''moment capture'', which I understand may be your choice for an appropriate portrait here.  Just wish the edge of the cushion was out of frame, but .. difficult.', '2006-12-15 07:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119921, 437064, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Too tightly cropped in my opinion and too much blur and oof areas.  The lighting is very nice on the dog''s right eye, but more use of that lighting plus a little sharper on both make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Too tightly cropped in my opinion and too much blur and oof areas.  The lighting is very nice on the dog''s right eye, but more use of that lighting plus a little sharper on both make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 07:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119922, 437953, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not really a strong portrait in my opinion.  Bigger, if you had the quality, make this better, plus obviously a variation in crop - unless this is intentional.  Also, not sure ''what'', but seems to be noise and lines/something in this image - could be pixelation issues.</td>', '3 - Not really a strong portrait in my opinion.  Bigger, if you had the quality, make this better, plus obviously a variation in crop - unless this is intentional.  Also, not sure ''what'', but seems to be noise and lines/something in this image - could be pixelation issues.', '2006-12-15 07:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119923, 435637, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - That''s very nice and those eyes pop right out the frame/screen.  Even with the ''goob'' on the tongue and the oof(?) areas on the nose, a nice portrait.  Not sure ont he frame, especially color choice.  Nice color combinations in the image.</td>', '7 - That''s very nice and those eyes pop right out the frame/screen.  Even with the ''goob'' on the tongue and the oof(?) areas on the nose, a nice portrait.  Not sure ont he frame, especially color choice.  Nice color combinations in the image.', '2006-12-15 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119926, 436382, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - A different angle and background would have helped with this in my opinion.  Frame is too strong also for this image.  A little sharper too.</td>', '4 - A different angle and background would have helped with this in my opinion.  Frame is too strong also for this image.  A little sharper too.', '2006-12-15 07:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119928, 437743, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Bit sharper on Whiskers with a variation in composition/framing help this in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Bit sharper on Whiskers with a variation in composition/framing help this in my opinion.', '2006-12-15 07:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119930, 438040, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh, that''s nice.  Like to have seen some more height framewise - maybe.  Just the few areas like bottom right and perhaps just behind the ear upper left cropped out ''somehow'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the softness, but do wonder about more clarity/sharper in the eyes.</td>', '8 - Oh, that''s nice.  Like to have seen some more height framewise - maybe.  Just the few areas like bottom right and perhaps just behind the ear upper left cropped out ''somehow'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the softness, but do wonder about more clarity/sharper in the eyes.', '2006-12-15 07:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119931, 438048, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not my kind of humor here and not a particularly ''good pet portrait'', from the pet''s perspective.</td>', '2 - Not my kind of humor here and not a particularly ''good pet portrait'', from the pet''s perspective.', '2006-12-15 07:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119933, 435696, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Quite a nice portrait - mainly just the color of the cushion dominates too much in my opinion and the cropped paw.</td>', '5 - Quite a nice portrait - mainly just the color of the cushion dominates too much in my opinion and the cropped paw.', '2006-12-15 07:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119935, 437423, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept, although the title makes this a little ''melancholy'', just like to have seen the dog sharper/less blur.  Perhaps some color in frame to offset the flower.. not sure.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept, although the title makes this a little ''melancholy'', just like to have seen the dog sharper/less blur.  Perhaps some color in frame to offset the flower.. not sure.', '2006-12-15 07:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119937, 436888, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Quite a nice ''traditional'' style studio portrait pose.. perhaps a variation in the background, etc.. coloring - something to bring out Opal''s lovely green eyes more.</td>', '7 - Quite a nice ''traditional'' style studio portrait pose.. perhaps a variation in the background, etc.. coloring - something to bring out Opal''s lovely green eyes more.', '2006-12-15 07:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
