(3119941, 437555, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Possibly good potential but looks like some resizing issues have deteriorated the quality.  The red ''something'' dominates too much in my opinion.  There is also ''something'' in the middle of that ''red''.. not sure what.</td>', '3 - Possibly good potential but looks like some resizing issues have deteriorated the quality.  The red ''something'' dominates too much in my opinion.  There is also ''something'' in the middle of that ''red''.. not sure what.', '2006-12-15 07:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119943, 436944, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - The Diva doesn''t look too comfortable.. yet sleeps so soundly.  Nice portait and composition.  Toning works well.</td>', '8 - The Diva doesn''t look too comfortable.. yet sleeps so soundly.  Nice portait and composition.  Toning works well.', '2006-12-15 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119947, 437218, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh boy, good title.  Nice portrait, like the angle, don''t mind the brown ''edge'' - gives some context and perspective.  Softness works here, but do wonder about a fraction sharper but who knows.  I just like your title with this image.  Funny.</td>', '8 - Oh boy, good title.  Nice portrait, like the angle, don''t mind the brown ''edge'' - gives some context and perspective.  Softness works here, but do wonder about a fraction sharper but who knows.  I just like your title with this image.  Funny.', '2006-12-15 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
