(3120012, 437536, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good Lord.. I thought this was a statue/figurine.  Good portrait and very good background/elements.  Nice colors.  Good focus/focal areas.  Perhaps the main thing is an odd ''finish'' to the image, which could be post processing.. that and the tip of the tail, but fairly minor.</td>', '8 - Good Lord.. I thought this was a statue/figurine.  Good portrait and very good background/elements.  Nice colors.  Good focus/focal areas.  Perhaps the main thing is an odd ''finish'' to the image, which could be post processing.. that and the tip of the tail, but fairly minor.', '2006-12-15 07:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3120017, 437418, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice portrait.  The ear chopped.. undecided.. obviously works as is, but.. maybe if it were there this might be even better, your call anyway, obviously.  Very nice capture, including character.</td>', '8 - Very nice portrait.  The ear chopped.. undecided.. obviously works as is, but.. maybe if it were there this might be even better, your call anyway, obviously.  Very nice capture, including character.', '2006-12-15 08:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
