(3120476, 438100, 208, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of things <i>not quite right</i> with this shot. The subject is too centered, vertically and horizontally. The crop of the body is weird. The ears flop awkwardly. The dog looks bored. The wallpaper is ugly.<br/> <br/>The overall effect is a lot like the look of <i>The Royal Tenenbaums</i>.<br/> <br/>Which is why it works so well. Two wrongs may not make a right, but it looks like a bunch of wrongs make for a great photo, or at least a distinctive style. 9</td>', 'There are a lot of things not quite right with this shot. The subject is too centered, vertically and horizontally. The crop of the body is weird. The ears flop awkwardly. The dog looks bored. The wallpaper is ugly. The overall effect is a lot like the look of The Royal Tenenbaums. Which is why it works so well. Two wrongs may not make a right, but it looks like a bunch of wrongs make for a great photo, or at least a distinctive style. 9', '2006-12-15 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
