(3121332, 437452, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice shot of Chappy II.  The blue stones dominate the image a fraction too much in my opinion.  Good composition and elements though.  Wish it were 640.</td>', '5 - Nice shot of Chappy II.  The blue stones dominate the image a fraction too much in my opinion.  Good composition and elements though.  Wish it were 640.', '2006-12-15 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
