(3123040, 436983, 64571, '<td valign="top">How cute!!!  Refreshing to see something diffrent (even though I''m one of the ones who entered a cat).</td>', 'How cute!!!  Refreshing to see something diffrent (even though I''m one of the ones who entered a cat).', '2006-12-16 08:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
