(3123117, 436959, 40797, '<td valign="top">What a face!! Those eyes are so sweet and trusting. You could not of picked a cuter subject!! I just want to pick up that little one up and give him/her a great big old bear hug. I LOVE it! I think that your contrast beween the blue on the blanket and the soft brown fur is wonderful and your composition is fantastic- I love the way that the focus is on puppy''s eyes.</td>', 'What a face!! Those eyes are so sweet and trusting. You could not of picked a cuter subject!! I just want to pick up that little one up and give him/her a great big old bear hug. I LOVE it! I think that your contrast beween the blue on the blanket and the soft brown fur is wonderful and your composition is fantastic- I love the way that the focus is on puppy''s eyes.', '2006-12-16 08:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123118, 437907, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, a portrait has controlled lighting and setting.  The chairs make for a busy background, and while the cone (or whatever they are called) tells a story it makes it look like he put his head through something.  The tag doesn''t help either.</td>', 'To me, a portrait has controlled lighting and setting.  The chairs make for a busy background, and while the cone (or whatever they are called) tells a story it makes it look like he put his head through something.  The tag doesn''t help either.', '2006-12-16 08:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
