(3123230, 437687, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should show enough of the animal to know something about him/her.  I think this is a horse, but there is no clue as to what makes him/her a pet, friend, and teacher.</td>', 'I think a portrait should show enough of the animal to know something about him/her.  I think this is a horse, but there is no clue as to what makes him/her a pet, friend, and teacher.', '2006-12-16 09:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
