(3124419, 438080, 64623, '<td valign="top">I love the soft colors on this.  Somehow, the child seems to be more the focus of the picture than the pet -- so it doesn''t quite fit the challenge exactly.  But I love it anyway!</td>', 'I love the soft colors on this.  Somehow, the child seems to be more the focus of the picture than the pet -- so it doesn''t quite fit the challenge exactly.  But I love it anyway!', '2006-12-16 21:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
