(3125649, 436983, 41521, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous ferret.  I''d love to see more shots of him down at his level.</td>', 'That is a gorgeous ferret.  I''d love to see more shots of him down at his level.', '2006-12-17 13:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125650, 437858, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is interesting...what are the lines in front of the cat? Normally I wouldn''t like that at all, but somehow they seem to go with the cat. Good!</td>', 'This is interesting...what are the lines in front of the cat? Normally I wouldn''t like that at all, but somehow they seem to go with the cat. Good!', '2006-12-17 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125653, 437743, 41521, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be sharper, colors are washed out and seem yellowish.</td>', 'Focus needs to be sharper, colors are washed out and seem yellowish.', '2006-12-17 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125654, 437173, 48968, '<td valign="top">Whoa. Crazy contrast and textures. Tom looks like fungus growing from a charred stump years after a forest fire...but in a good way (?) :-) Interesting image and unique for this challenge. I like Tom. 7</td>', 'Whoa. Crazy contrast and textures. Tom looks like fungus growing from a charred stump years after a forest fire...but in a good way (?) :-) Interesting image and unique for this challenge. I like Tom. 7', '2006-12-17 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125656, 437173, 63269, '<td valign="top">AMAZING detail and textures. Good use of sepia, too.</td>', 'AMAZING detail and textures. Good use of sepia, too.', '2006-12-17 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125659, 436745, 41521, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and great colors.  Gradient in the background and reflection pull my attention away from the subject.  Would love to see a tighter crop without the white flower.</td>', 'Beautiful bird and great colors.  Gradient in the background and reflection pull my attention away from the subject.  Would love to see a tighter crop without the white flower.', '2006-12-17 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125662, 438063, 48968, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait. Great lighting, strong eyes, nice use of the pillow (couch) as a prop - the color is a perfect contrast to the black of the cat. Nice image.</td>', 'I like this portrait. Great lighting, strong eyes, nice use of the pillow (couch) as a prop - the color is a perfect contrast to the black of the cat. Nice image.', '2006-12-17 13:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125667, 437225, 41521, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, love the expression.  Wish the reflection didn''t have the tree branches or whatever it is around the head.</td>', 'Excellent capture, love the expression.  Wish the reflection didn''t have the tree branches or whatever it is around the head.', '2006-12-17 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125668, 436233, 41521, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2006-12-17 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125670, 437572, 41521, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.  Those eyes are great, and you did an excellent job capturing them.  The detail and sharpness is incredible.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.  Those eyes are great, and you did an excellent job capturing them.  The detail and sharpness is incredible.', '2006-12-17 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125671, 435497, 48968, '<td valign="top">It looks like the focus is on the prop (tin man) rather than the dogs. I would have liked to have seen the dogs sharper (and in focus). Also, the backdrop has distracting light areas (to the right on the sitting dog, top right of frame...). Also, the front of the back drop is exposed showing the floor beneath, which doesn''t add anything to the image. This is just nit-picky stuff though, so take it for what it''s worth :-) - it''s a cute image. 5</td>', 'It looks like the focus is on the prop (tin man) rather than the dogs. I would have liked to have seen the dogs sharper (and in focus). Also, the backdrop has distracting light areas (to the right on the sitting dog, top right of frame...). Also, the front of the back drop is exposed showing the floor beneath, which doesn''t add anything to the image. This is just nit-picky stuff though, so take it for what it''s worth :-) - it''s a cute image. 5', '2006-12-17 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125673, 437948, 41521, '<td valign="top">Stanley is a regal looking young man.  I think he would have been shown off better with a different backdrop and less muted lighting.</td>', 'Stanley is a regal looking young man.  I think he would have been shown off better with a different backdrop and less muted lighting.', '2006-12-17 13:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125677, 437959, 48968, '<td valign="top">Extracting an image with hair in Photoshop is a very difficult task to do well. This could use a little work in that department. 5</td>', 'Extracting an image with hair in Photoshop is a very difficult task to do well. This could use a little work in that department. 5', '2006-12-17 13:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125680, 437629, 48968, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is a stunning image. Great focus, detail and lighting. 7</td>', 'Wow. This is a stunning image. Great focus, detail and lighting. 7', '2006-12-17 13:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125681, 436099, 48968, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.</td>', 'This is hilarious.', '2006-12-17 13:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125683, 436355, 48968, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, with great lighting - I just wish I could see the eyes better. 7</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, with great lighting - I just wish I could see the eyes better. 7', '2006-12-17 13:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125686, 438070, 67395, '<td valign="top">Cute, nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'Cute, nice lighting and composition.', '2006-12-17 13:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125690, 437981, 48968, '<td valign="top">It looks as if the jpg compression has done some damage to the clarity of the image. 5</td>', 'It looks as if the jpg compression has done some damage to the clarity of the image. 5', '2006-12-17 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125692, 438078, 70006, '<td valign="top">Innovative Life is always beter through the rear view mirror</td>', 'Innovative Life is always beter through the rear view mirror', '2006-12-17 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125698, 438018, 67697, '<td valign="top">This photo is a scream!  The tongue sticking out really sells it.  Hope this one is getting a good Christmas treat for posing and actually keeping the costume on!</td>', 'This photo is a scream!  The tongue sticking out really sells it.  Hope this one is getting a good Christmas treat for posing and actually keeping the costume on!', '2006-12-17 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125700, 436136, 70006, '<td valign="top">pretty bird</td>', 'pretty bird', '2006-12-17 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125706, 436359, 70006, '<td valign="top">sweet</td>', 'sweet', '2006-12-17 13:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125708, 437967, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish your entry was larger. It looks really cute and I like the lighting, just very small compared to the other entries.</td>', 'For me, I wish your entry was larger. It looks really cute and I like the lighting, just very small compared to the other entries.', '2006-12-17 13:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125711, 437839, 67395, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, lighting, and focus.</td>', 'Nice capture, lighting, and focus.', '2006-12-17 13:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125712, 436927, 67395, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and composition of this photo.</td>', 'I like the lighting and composition of this photo.', '2006-12-17 13:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125714, 436929, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great backdrop for this dog. I like the overall color too. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great backdrop for this dog. I like the overall color too. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-17 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125717, 437756, 67395, '<td valign="top">Elegant, beautiful lighting, and nice composition.</td>', 'Elegant, beautiful lighting, and nice composition.', '2006-12-17 13:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125719, 436969, 67395, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting.</td>', 'I really like the lighting.', '2006-12-17 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125720, 438080, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awwww....I remember when my beagle was that tiny. What a precious photo! They have the sweetest faces. If there was a bit more color contast, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Awwww....I remember when my beagle was that tiny. What a precious photo! They have the sweetest faces. If there was a bit more color contast, I would have scored it higher.', '2006-12-17 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125724, 437629, 41675, '<td valign="top">A wise and sweet face. A really nice closeup yet for me, I think just a bit less cropping would work better - give it more... "breathing room." 8</td>', 'A wise and sweet face. A really nice closeup yet for me, I think just a bit less cropping would work better - give it more... "breathing room." 8', '2006-12-17 13:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125725, 437674, 67395, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting...wish you could see the entire eye.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting...wish you could see the entire eye.', '2006-12-17 13:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125727, 437726, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice and regal-like. Fitting for a cat. I like the color scheme as well.</td>', 'Very nice and regal-like. Fitting for a cat. I like the color scheme as well.', '2006-12-17 13:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125728, 437316, 41675, '<td valign="top">nice closeup. I like it. Nice variation from all the cats and dogs too.</td>', 'nice closeup. I like it. Nice variation from all the cats and dogs too.', '2006-12-17 13:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125730, 437412, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aww, what a cutie! Nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Aww, what a cutie! Nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-17 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125731, 436695, 41675, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog and nice portrait. I like the eyes and wonder what it''s looking at.</td>', 'Beautiful dog and nice portrait. I like the eyes and wonder what it''s looking at.', '2006-12-17 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125733, 436302, 67395, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice focus and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful, nice focus and composition.', '2006-12-17 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125734, 436430, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white. You''ve captured that typical "haughty" cat look. Well done.</td>', 'Nice black and white. You''ve captured that typical "haughty" cat look. Well done.', '2006-12-17 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125735, 437725, 67395, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, colors, and composition.</td>', 'Love the lighting, colors, and composition.', '2006-12-17 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125736, 438110, 67395, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and great lighting, but the background distracts from the dog.</td>', 'Nice capture and great lighting, but the background distracts from the dog.', '2006-12-17 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125739, 437291, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the blue tones. The eyes might be a bit too blue, but still nice. I also like the added element of the pearls.</td>', 'I like the blue tones. The eyes might be a bit too blue, but still nice. I also like the added element of the pearls.', '2006-12-17 13:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125741, 437572, 67395, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Great lighting and focus. I bet some are saying its over sharpened.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Great lighting and focus. I bet some are saying its over sharpened.', '2006-12-17 13:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125744, 437460, 67395, '<td valign="top">Great natural lighting! Nice capture.</td>', 'Great natural lighting! Nice capture.', '2006-12-17 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125745, 436260, 65324, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-12-17 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125746, 437082, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great outdoor shot. The stick, the water and the lighting all combine to make your image work for me. Well done.</td>', 'Great outdoor shot. The stick, the water and the lighting all combine to make your image work for me. Well done.', '2006-12-17 13:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125747, 435497, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - points for humor. The two little greenish areas in the front are a little distracting, but still a cute photo.</td>', 'Lol - points for humor. The two little greenish areas in the front are a little distracting, but still a cute photo.', '2006-12-17 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125748, 437844, 65324, '<td valign="top">Good Contrast and Cropping.  Needs to be a little sharper.  Pretty horse.</td>', 'Good Contrast and Cropping.  Needs to be a little sharper.  Pretty horse.', '2006-12-17 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125751, 437053, 65324, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping, color and focusing.  Beautiful dog.</td>', 'Nice cropping, color and focusing.  Beautiful dog.', '2006-12-17 13:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125755, 436429, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - great capture of the squirrel. I think they''re cute. I wonder how this would look if the squirrel was more off to one side or the other. For me, having the main suject slightly off-centered adds more interest.</td>', 'Lol - great capture of the squirrel. I think they''re cute. I wonder how this would look if the squirrel was more off to one side or the other. For me, having the main suject slightly off-centered adds more interest.', '2006-12-17 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3125757, 438012, 65324, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog.  Love the black background.  Wish I could have seen more of the eyes.  6</td>', 'Beautiful dog.  Love the black background.  Wish I could have seen more of the eyes.  6', '2006-12-17 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125758, 436222, 41675, '<td valign="top">A really great, tight closeup. I like the color in the eyes. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A really great, tight closeup. I like the color in the eyes. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-17 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125761, 435355, 65324, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  Just like trying to take a family portrait.  There is always one that will close their eyes.  LOL!!!!  Great picture 10</td>', 'Adorable!  Just like trying to take a family portrait.  There is always one that will close their eyes.  LOL!!!!  Great picture 10', '2006-12-17 13:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125762, 436788, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-D How funny...what a cooperative dog. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', ':-D How funny...what a cooperative dog. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-17 13:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125766, 436600, 41675, '<td valign="top">Yup, those kind of eyes get ya every time. Very sweet shot.</td>', 'Yup, those kind of eyes get ya every time. Very sweet shot.', '2006-12-17 13:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125773, 437030, 65324, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog.  Good color, cropping contrast.  Would like to see it a little sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful dog.  Good color, cropping contrast.  Would like to see it a little sharper.', '2006-12-17 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125778, 437233, 65324, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Good lighting 7</td>', 'Sweet!  Good lighting 7', '2006-12-17 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125807, 436804, 44754, '<td valign="top">Portrait of ear hair?</td>', 'Portrait of ear hair?', '2006-12-17 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125811, 436745, 44754, '<td valign="top">looks over saturated. lots of noise</td>', 'looks over saturated. lots of noise', '2006-12-17 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125813, 436220, 44754, '<td valign="top">what''s with all the noise. What ISO?</td>', 'what''s with all the noise. What ISO?', '2006-12-17 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125818, 437963, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Looks like good potential, however the dog is not the dominant part of this image.  Perhaps a more creative approach could have given this extra - eg: losing the shirt and bringing the dog closer to the camera, etc.</td>', '2 - Looks like good potential, however the dog is not the dominant part of this image.  Perhaps a more creative approach could have given this extra - eg: losing the shirt and bringing the dog closer to the camera, etc.', '2006-12-17 14:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125820, 438018, 44754, '<td valign="top">Long haired Weimaraner?</td>', 'Long haired Weimaraner?', '2006-12-17 14:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125821, 437877, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Quite a nice portrait of Wolfie, but the tail chopped is not good and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  A few marks in front of the paws which are distracting.</td>', '4 - Quite a nice portrait of Wolfie, but the tail chopped is not good and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  A few marks in front of the paws which are distracting.', '2006-12-17 14:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125822, 437948, 44754, '<td valign="top">lighting is not quite right</td>', 'lighting is not quite right', '2006-12-17 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125823, 436981, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Lovely looking dog, but there seems to be a few issues, likely pp, here and there.  The corner of the eye looks odd, whether due to desat or what not sure, the outline of the fur/dog looks dodged and the background color is too harsh in my opinion.  Perhaps a different angle and not so tightly cropped, to give more room for ''the Shake'' to be seen, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Lovely looking dog, but there seems to be a few issues, likely pp, here and there.  The corner of the eye looks odd, whether due to desat or what not sure, the outline of the fur/dog looks dodged and the background color is too harsh in my opinion.  Perhaps a different angle and not so tightly cropped, to give more room for ''the Shake'' to be seen, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125825, 437172, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Might sound minor but, even the bird''s name would have made this more of a ''Pet Portrait'' in my opinion.  Like the crop, not sure that it is showing the bird as a ''portrait'' of it as well as further out would have, especially for this Challenge, but your call.</td>', '4 - Might sound minor but, even the bird''s name would have made this more of a ''Pet Portrait'' in my opinion.  Like the crop, not sure that it is showing the bird as a ''portrait'' of it as well as further out would have, especially for this Challenge, but your call.', '2006-12-17 14:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125826, 437173, 44754, '<td valign="top">Tasty Tom!</td>', 'Tasty Tom!', '2006-12-17 14:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125827, 436946, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this, but a few tweaks could have given it an edge in my opinion.  Examples:  variation in background color and lighting, more refined crop, especially at the bottom and less grain/noise.</td>', '6 - Like this, but a few tweaks could have given it an edge in my opinion.  Examples:  variation in background color and lighting, more refined crop, especially at the bottom and less grain/noise.', '2006-12-17 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125828, 437991, 44754, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. A bit too soft in the face for me.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. A bit too soft in the face for me.', '2006-12-17 14:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125829, 437955, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like it.  Prefer a more subtle title, but your call.</td>', '8 - Like it.  Prefer a more subtle title, but your call.', '2006-12-17 14:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125830, 437412, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Even with the oof nose, but it matches the shallow dof so still works, but likely ''if'' in focus as well, would have given this much more of an edge.  Like the eyes and lighting - ''if only'' Richard Hammond''s left eye was lit up as well as the right.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Even with the oof nose, but it matches the shallow dof so still works, but likely ''if'' in focus as well, would have given this much more of an edge.  Like the eyes and lighting - ''if only'' Richard Hammond''s left eye was lit up as well as the right.', '2006-12-17 14:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125832, 437260, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice portrait and pose.  Just the tips of the ears and the dominance of the rug/blanket/whatever mainly.</td>', '6 - Nice portrait and pose.  Just the tips of the ears and the dominance of the rug/blanket/whatever mainly.', '2006-12-17 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125836, 437674, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the composition and crop but sharper on the eyes and the ''effect'' around the whiskers minimized and few ''blothces'' bottom right eliminated, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like the composition and crop but sharper on the eyes and the ''effect'' around the whiskers minimized and few ''blothces'' bottom right eliminated, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125840, 437811, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Bigger (640) and sharper/less blur and the grain/something minimized bringing in more clarity, make this better in my opinion.  Good potential, lighting looks nice.  A little more space at the top too.</td>', '4 - Bigger (640) and sharper/less blur and the grain/something minimized bringing in more clarity, make this better in my opinion.  Good potential, lighting looks nice.  A little more space at the top too.', '2006-12-17 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125843, 437173, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Not sure this is Tom''s best side... Nice portrait, but <i>do</i> think trying to gain a little more ''face'' (somehow) make this even better.  Background elements are distracting, despite the good applied tones.</td>', '6 - Not sure this is Tom''s best side... Nice portrait, but do think trying to gain a little more ''face'' (somehow) make this even better.  Background elements are distracting, despite the good applied tones.', '2006-12-17 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125846, 437829, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks like good potential but with the sofa in the background visible makes this appear more of a snapshot.  Variation in lighting and more refined crop, and sharper/less blur, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks like good potential but with the sofa in the background visible makes this appear more of a snapshot.  Variation in lighting and more refined crop, and sharper/less blur, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125848, 436011, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a great close-up (gotta love those aussie eyes!)</td>', 'You''ve captured a great close-up (gotta love those aussie eyes!)', '2006-12-17 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125850, 437416, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Lovely shot of Millie, just the left background inconsistent with the right.. works, but competes too much for attention with Millie''s face in my opinion.  Nice eyes, wonder about them a little further down the frame, but your call obviously.</td>', '8 - Lovely shot of Millie, just the left background inconsistent with the right.. works, but competes too much for attention with Millie''s face in my opinion.  Nice eyes, wonder about them a little further down the frame, but your call obviously.', '2006-12-17 14:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125852, 436969, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice profile of Lisa, wonder whether some more frame top and bottom and the ears not so cropped and, although nice as is, the light in her eye(s) a little stronger - just the whites around her snout dominate the image more than her eye, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice profile of Lisa, wonder whether some more frame top and bottom and the ears not so cropped and, although nice as is, the light in her eye(s) a little stronger - just the whites around her snout dominate the image more than her eye, in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125856, 437497, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not sure what you were going for here, but I''ll use your title as a guide.  A rotate and more refined crop would have likely helped this.</td>', '2 - Not sure what you were going for here, but I''ll use your title as a guide.  A rotate and more refined crop would have likely helped this.', '2006-12-17 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125860, 437387, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Oh, looks like such good potential.... ''if only'' the fore blanket/fabric not so dominant and the cat''s face ''larger''/bigger frame (640), sharper focus on the cat''s face and the eyes open just a <i>little</i> more.. would have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Oh, looks like such good potential.... ''if only'' the fore blanket/fabric not so dominant and the cat''s face ''larger''/bigger frame (640), sharper focus on the cat''s face and the eyes open just a little more.. would have made this much better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125866, 437291, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the setup, but the fur looks like it has.. almost been air brushed, which could just be a shallow dof or pp, who knows.  The colors are nice, but in my opinion there is a range of blues here that may need a little more attention to prevent either clashing or competition with the cat''s eyes.  Sharper on the eyes, less noise/grain, more ''depth'' and the ''blue fur'' on the left in less focus than the cat - make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like the setup, but the fur looks like it has.. almost been air brushed, which could just be a shallow dof or pp, who knows.  The colors are nice, but in my opinion there is a range of blues here that may need a little more attention to prevent either clashing or competition with the cat''s eyes.  Sharper on the eyes, less noise/grain, more ''depth'' and the ''blue fur'' on the left in less focus than the cat - make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 14:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125869, 437967, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Sure looks like good potential, what I can discern looks like needs to be sharper on the eyes and the box(?) in the background likely eliminated - but your main problem (if the quality is there) is the size here, which needs to be 640.  Not sure your title matches the image, but your call.</td>', '3 - Sure looks like good potential, what I can discern looks like needs to be sharper on the eyes and the box(?) in the background likely eliminated - but your main problem (if the quality is there) is the size here, which needs to be 640.  Not sure your title matches the image, but your call.', '2006-12-17 14:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125886, 438123, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - For this Challenge would have liked to have seen the dog''s eyes more/open.  Sharper too and a more refined crop, make this better in my opinion.  Nice image, but for this Challenge, as mentioned - just like to have seen the dog''s eyes, etc.</td>', '5 - For this Challenge would have liked to have seen the dog''s eyes more/open.  Sharper too and a more refined crop, make this better in my opinion.  Nice image, but for this Challenge, as mentioned - just like to have seen the dog''s eyes, etc.', '2006-12-17 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125891, 437053, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Charlie''s outline looks a little odd - almost ''spriteish'', not sure if this is pp or what.  His eyes with more lighting and maybe also getting down to his level, may have made this better in my opinion.  640 too.</td>', '4 - Charlie''s outline looks a little odd - almost ''spriteish'', not sure if this is pp or what.  His eyes with more lighting and maybe also getting down to his level, may have made this better in my opinion.  640 too.', '2006-12-17 15:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125892, 436017, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice pose/capture of Zoeyy, but the orientation looks ''warped'', needs rotating ''somewhere''.  Better focus on Zoeyy''s face and the paws/tail not chopped, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Nice pose/capture of Zoeyy, but the orientation looks ''warped'', needs rotating ''somewhere''.  Better focus on Zoeyy''s face and the paws/tail not chopped, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125897, 435779, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept however, in my opinion the box color (and possibly also the pattern) is not enhancing the cat''s color/pattern.  Focus seems good, but the pose .. just would like to have seen a variation.  The perspective is making the paws seem pretty big, but maybe he/she has big paws, who knows.  Additionally, the red poinsettia(?) at the rear is causing another ''color clash'' in my opinion and the black background enhances all the color range.  A more refined cop, especially at the dges of the box, plus a rotate up on the left to get the ''lines'' straight, also make this better in my opinion.  Not sure the vertical framing work as well as a more horizontal or square one would have.</td>', '4 - Like the concept however, in my opinion the box color (and possibly also the pattern) is not enhancing the cat''s color/pattern.  Focus seems good, but the pose .. just would like to have seen a variation.  The perspective is making the paws seem pretty big, but maybe he/she has big paws, who knows.  Additionally, the red poinsettia(?) at the rear is causing another ''color clash'' in my opinion and the black background enhances all the color range.  A more refined cop, especially at the dges of the box, plus a rotate up on the left to get the ''lines'' straight, also make this better in my opinion.  Not sure the vertical framing work as well as a more horizontal or square one would have.', '2006-12-17 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125902, 438065, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Looks too close and not sharp enough, but also there is a yellow tint here which perhaps is caused by artificial light and the exposure settings not adjusted accordingly.  LIke the composition, but not so tightly cropped at the bottom also likely have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Looks too close and not sharp enough, but also there is a yellow tint here which perhaps is caused by artificial light and the exposure settings not adjusted accordingly.  LIke the composition, but not so tightly cropped at the bottom also likely have helped this in my opinion.', '2006-12-17 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
