(3127942, 436283, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Like the perspective.  The ''smooth'' finish to this works well, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more width and the background more subtle, to let the cat dominate more, but minor.  Could just be visual, but looks like it needs a nudge rotate up on the left to ''straighten'' - maybe.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Like the perspective.  The ''smooth'' finish to this works well, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more width and the background more subtle, to let the cat dominate more, but minor.  Could just be visual, but looks like it needs a nudge rotate up on the left to ''straighten'' - maybe.', '2006-12-18 06:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
