(3127948, 437966, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the close crop and bell element.  Not sure the background, color primarily, complements the cat''s color as well as a variation may have.  Biggest thing in my opinion in this shot is the eyes and overall ''feel'' perhaps due to pp - seems unnatural.  Likely just ''personal taste'' though.  Blown areas too, but fairly minor - but again, perhaps you were going for that.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Like the close crop and bell element.  Not sure the background, color primarily, complements the cat''s color as well as a variation may have.  Biggest thing in my opinion in this shot is the eyes and overall ''feel'' perhaps due to pp - seems unnatural.  Likely just ''personal taste'' though.  Blown areas too, but fairly minor - but again, perhaps you were going for that.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2006-12-18 06:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
