(3128412, 436944, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the soft "spotlight" look and feel to this portrait. The B&amp;W color, the elements of the white couch with the beaded pillow there, and the lighting all invoke the idea of a scene from a 1940''s classic movie. The star in the spotlight is that downy, white poochie that didn''t just faint onto the couch but is fast asleep on it:-) The only thing that I would suggest to improve is another small light to lessen the harsh shadow that appears under the dog. You don''t want to ruin that "broadway"/movie feel of the lighting but just lessen (possibly eliminate) the shadow there so that we see more of the curved contours &amp; face of the dog to increase the visual impact. Lovely composition: 8</td>', 'Love the soft "spotlight" look and feel to this portrait. The B&W color, the elements of the white couch with the beaded pillow there, and the lighting all invoke the idea of a scene from a 1940''s classic movie. The star in the spotlight is that downy, white poochie that didn''t just faint onto the couch but is fast asleep on it:-) The only thing that I would suggest to improve is another small light to lessen the harsh shadow that appears under the dog. You don''t want to ruin that "broadway"/movie feel of the lighting but just lessen (possibly eliminate) the shadow there so that we see more of the curved contours & face of the dog to increase the visual impact. Lovely composition: 8', '2006-12-18 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128427, 436986, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great portrait that really captures the spirit of "sad puppy dog eyes". Zoe nailed the expression perfectly and you captured the expression well. The white background is a good high contrast color to allow this black dog to really pop visually. Illumination on your subject is great with no harsh shadows so that we see all the lovely details of this dog not to mention the nice soft sheen on the fur.</td>', 'Great portrait that really captures the spirit of "sad puppy dog eyes". Zoe nailed the expression perfectly and you captured the expression well. The white background is a good high contrast color to allow this black dog to really pop visually. Illumination on your subject is great with no harsh shadows so that we see all the lovely details of this dog not to mention the nice soft sheen on the fur.', '2006-12-18 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128447, 438012, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the reddish brown hues on this dog. Beautiful coloring and nice expression on the dog''s face, but it needs more lighting for it to really leap off the page. The right half of the dog falls into some shadow such that we don''t get the same level of detail &amp; hue as that of the left side. Even lighting across the dog''s face will increase visual appeal and impact. That is the only weakness to the image that keeps it at an 8 where it could be in the 9-10''s category.</td>', 'Love the reddish brown hues on this dog. Beautiful coloring and nice expression on the dog''s face, but it needs more lighting for it to really leap off the page. The right half of the dog falls into some shadow such that we don''t get the same level of detail & hue as that of the left side. Even lighting across the dog''s face will increase visual appeal and impact. That is the only weakness to the image that keeps it at an 8 where it could be in the 9-10''s category.', '2006-12-18 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128467, 435497, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the composition - the tin man with the two Toto''s:-) Lighting is good but it could stand to add just a smidge more to further illuminate the darker pup and the right side of the Tin Man that falls into shadow. Lastly, the darker colored pup and the tin man appear in sharper focus but the focus on the light brown dog is soft and not as sharp. Use of a higher F-stop would increase the depth of field.</td>', 'Love the composition - the tin man with the two Toto''s:-) Lighting is good but it could stand to add just a smidge more to further illuminate the darker pup and the right side of the Tin Man that falls into shadow. Lastly, the darker colored pup and the tin man appear in sharper focus but the focus on the light brown dog is soft and not as sharp. Use of a higher F-stop would increase the depth of field.', '2006-12-18 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128482, 436378, 43463, '<td valign="top">"Oh! Please Mr. Tiger, don''t eat me up, and I''ll give you my beautiful little Red (er brown &amp; white) Coat," said Little Babaji. <br/> <br/>This Little Babaji seems to be holding his hands together pleading with the tiger like that of Babaji in the story. This is a wonderful close-up of this hamster. We get to see all the great details from the whiskers to the little fingers to the texture of his fur.</td>', '"Oh! Please Mr. Tiger, don''t eat me up, and I''ll give you my beautiful little Red (er brown & white) Coat," said Little Babaji.  This Little Babaji seems to be holding his hands together pleading with the tiger like that of Babaji in the story. This is a wonderful close-up of this hamster. We get to see all the great details from the whiskers to the little fingers to the texture of his fur.', '2006-12-18 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128566, 438062, 69448, '<td valign="top">A rotation would be nice. The would be okay if it was rotated as it should</td>', 'A rotation would be nice. The would be okay if it was rotated as it should', '2006-12-18 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
