(3128750, 437225, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great job using the reflection to enhance the photo.  My only nitpick is the very light inner border, not sure if it''s intentional or not.</td>', 'Great job using the reflection to enhance the photo.  My only nitpick is the very light inner border, not sure if it''s intentional or not.', '2006-12-18 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
