(3128811, 436996, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a tired pooch! A nice portrait shot of this dog. I think that a vertical composition would have better suited this photo than the horizontal one. The reason, there is just too much ''empty space'' floating on both sides of the dog that do nothing for the composition. The vertical one would better frame the sides of the head thereby keeping the attention more tightly focused on the tired dog.</td>', 'What a tired pooch! A nice portrait shot of this dog. I think that a vertical composition would have better suited this photo than the horizontal one. The reason, there is just too much ''empty space'' floating on both sides of the dog that do nothing for the composition. The vertical one would better frame the sides of the head thereby keeping the attention more tightly focused on the tired dog.', '2006-12-18 13:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128871, 437750, 65779, '<td valign="top">I like the smile.</td>', 'I like the smile.', '2006-12-18 14:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128966, 435945, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Perhaps a little ''groom'' would have given this an edge, unless you were going for the ''ungroomed'' look.  Background color not bringing the coat pattern and color out as much as a variation may have, also some grain/noise visible.</td>', '5 - Perhaps a little ''groom'' would have given this an edge, unless you were going for the ''ungroomed'' look.  Background color not bringing the coat pattern and color out as much as a variation may have, also some grain/noise visible.', '2006-12-18 14:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128970, 436222, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept, colors look a little odd, likely due to pp.  Wish the eyes were as sharp as the nose.  Some issues in the darker areas, but could be due to resizing.</td>', '4 - Like the concept, colors look a little odd, likely due to pp.  Wish the eyes were as sharp as the nose.  Some issues in the darker areas, but could be due to resizing.', '2006-12-18 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128975, 436000, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Seems to be some grain/noise and the focus is off/perhaps some blur.  Like to have seen the eyes sharper, a nudge rotate up on the right and variation of background.</td>', '3 - Seems to be some grain/noise and the focus is off/perhaps some blur.  Like to have seen the eyes sharper, a nudge rotate up on the right and variation of background.', '2006-12-18 14:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128979, 436548, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept.  Like to have seen Juliet more dominant in the frame/bigger, so a tighter crop.  Perhaps a wider framing as well.</td>', '5 - Like the concept.  Like to have seen Juliet more dominant in the frame/bigger, so a tighter crop.  Perhaps a wider framing as well.', '2006-12-18 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128984, 435459, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Looks very snapshottish.  More attention paid to base/background, flash / lighting issues, blur, etc, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Looks very snapshottish.  More attention paid to base/background, flash / lighting issues, blur, etc, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128989, 438030, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Background not enhancing Mimbi, but mainly it is Mimbi''s left eye - like this just makes a ''weird'' image.  Sharper and variation in composition/framing, likely have helped.</td>', '3 - Background not enhancing Mimbi, but mainly it is Mimbi''s left eye - like this just makes a ''weird'' image.  Sharper and variation in composition/framing, likely have helped.', '2006-12-18 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128990, 437461, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice pose.  Variation in the background so it doesn''t compete with Euler, plus variation in the cropping, make this better in my opinion.  The reflection/lighting in the eyes too.</td>', '4 - Nice pose.  Variation in the background so it doesn''t compete with Euler, plus variation in the cropping, make this better in my opinion.  The reflection/lighting in the eyes too.', '2006-12-18 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128997, 436429, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not sure this is a ''Pet'' - good capture otherwise, except for the obvious leg chop.</td>', '2 - Not sure this is a ''Pet'' - good capture otherwise, except for the obvious leg chop.', '2006-12-18 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129003, 437752, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Don''t mind the zoom effect, but the tongue saved for another Challenge, be better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Don''t mind the zoom effect, but the tongue saved for another Challenge, be better in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129008, 437580, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice portrait of Crumb.  More refined crop on the left and a little sharper (or could be resizing issues), make this better in my opinion.  Seems to be gamma/something issues in the dark ''corners'' here and there.</td>', '7 - Nice portrait of Crumb.  More refined crop on the left and a little sharper (or could be resizing issues), make this better in my opinion.  Seems to be gamma/something issues in the dark ''corners'' here and there.', '2006-12-18 14:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129012, 436996, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - The green fabric competes too much with the dog, as does the background.  Sharper on the dog with a variation in lighting - especially for the eyes, make this better in my opinion.  Frame is too thick for this image - again, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - The green fabric competes too much with the dog, as does the background.  Sharper on the dog with a variation in lighting - especially for the eyes, make this better in my opinion.  Frame is too thick for this image - again, in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129021, 438108, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this, but wish the eyes were both lit like the cat''s right.  The few blown areas are a little distracting.  Seems to be some noise/gamma here and there but could be intentional. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-20 05:55:03.</i></td>', '6 - Like this, but wish the eyes were both lit like the cat''s right.  The few blown areas are a little distracting.  Seems to be some noise/gamma here and there but could be intentional. edit:typo', '2006-12-18 14:58:58.000000', '2006-12-20 05:55:03.000000', 1),
(3129024, 437637, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like to have seen this with less empty space and more ''pop'' (seems a little ''hazy'') - but your call, obviously.</td>', '6 - Like to have seen this with less empty space and more ''pop'' (seems a little ''hazy'') - but your call, obviously.', '2006-12-18 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129028, 438101, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Very good potential, not sure you''ve attained it as much as a variation in composition, background and framing may have.  Outline looks a little ''odd''.</td>', '4 - Very good potential, not sure you''ve attained it as much as a variation in composition, background and framing may have.  Outline looks a little ''odd''.', '2006-12-18 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129030, 436665, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice capture, especially of the light.  Wish the dog wasn''t getting lost within the surrounds as much and the light was a little more subtle.</td>', '5 - Nice capture, especially of the light.  Wish the dog wasn''t getting lost within the surrounds as much and the light was a little more subtle.', '2006-12-18 15:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129036, 436011, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice but not sure that the softness works with the black background, but your call.  Like to have seen it sharper and variation in background to help bring out and complement the ''eyes'' more. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-20 05:53:39.</i></td>', '6 - Nice but not sure that the softness works with the black background, but your call.  Like to have seen it sharper and variation in background to help bring out and complement the ''eyes'' more. edit:typo', '2006-12-18 15:04:05.000000', '2006-12-20 05:53:39.000000', 1),
(3129040, 438031, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Lighting is too harsh on the fur and eyes.  Perhaps further away and a variation in angle/perspective (especially beause of the hat), make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Lighting is too harsh on the fur and eyes.  Perhaps further away and a variation in angle/perspective (especially beause of the hat), make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129055, 437681, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice pose/capture.  A quick clean of the eyes and trying to reduce the background, which competes too much, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Nice pose/capture.  A quick clean of the eyes and trying to reduce the background, which competes too much, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 15:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129062, 435663, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Wish the face was sharper for this Challenge.</td>', '3 - Wish the face was sharper for this Challenge.', '2006-12-18 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129066, 436921, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - The fore paw dominates too much in my opinion.  Variation in crop and possibly more of a horizontal framing, likely have helped this.</td>', '4 - The fore paw dominates too much in my opinion.  Variation in crop and possibly more of a horizontal framing, likely have helped this.', '2006-12-18 15:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129067, 437907, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice image of a little guy suffering through the<br/>wearing of one of those collars.  Wish that label<br/>could have been peeled off.  Hope your dog is better<br/>soon.</td>', 'Nice image of a little guy suffering through thewearing of one of those collars.  Wish that labelcould have been peeled off.  Hope your dog is bettersoon.', '2006-12-18 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129073, 436567, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the colors.  Perhaps intentionally dark, but too dark in my opinion - especially around the eyes.  Background dominates too much.  More refined crop and perhaps a nudge rotate up on the right.</td>', '4 - Like the colors.  Perhaps intentionally dark, but too dark in my opinion - especially around the eyes.  Background dominates too much.  More refined crop and perhaps a nudge rotate up on the right.', '2006-12-18 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129079, 437545, 56167, '<td valign="top">different shades through the bottom of the coat is distracting, nice cat though.</td>', 'different shades through the bottom of the coat is distracting, nice cat though.', '2006-12-18 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129080, 436351, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Nice macro and capture of the slit - but not meeting the Challenge as a portrait in my opinion.  Much more of an abstract, which works well as an image, but not for this Challenge.</td>', '2 - Nice macro and capture of the slit - but not meeting the Challenge as a portrait in my opinion.  Much more of an abstract, which works well as an image, but not for this Challenge.', '2006-12-18 15:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129081, 435443, 14476, '<td valign="top">A very interesting cat portrait.  Good colors to set off <br/>this long-haired beauty.</td>', 'A very interesting cat portrait.  Good colors to set off this long-haired beauty.', '2006-12-18 15:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129088, 437663, 56167, '<td valign="top">bad hair day, lovely shades</td>', 'bad hair day, lovely shades', '2006-12-18 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129091, 437456, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice focus</td>', 'nice focus', '2006-12-18 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129093, 436412, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice capture and colors - like to have seen the dog''s fur and eye a little more vivid / sharper and the grass more subtle.  A little more height/crop variation and the reflection ''reduced'', as well.</td>', '5 - Nice capture and colors - like to have seen the dog''s fur and eye a little more vivid / sharper and the grass more subtle.  A little more height/crop variation and the reflection ''reduced'', as well.', '2006-12-18 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129098, 437235, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept, wish it were sharper and had more ''drama'' - but for this Challenge like to have seen more dog and less ''abstract''/eye framing.</td>', '4 - Like the concept, wish it were sharper and had more ''drama'' - but for this Challenge like to have seen more dog and less ''abstract''/eye framing.', '2006-12-18 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129105, 437628, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image/portrait of Taco Belle.  Difficult, but ''even sharper'' around the face/eyes - as seems to be on the fabric at the fore, maybe.  Lighting a fraction more subtle too, mainly because of the light/white fur areas.</td>', '7 - Nice image/portrait of Taco Belle.  Difficult, but ''even sharper'' around the face/eyes - as seems to be on the fabric at the fore, maybe.  Lighting a fraction more subtle too, mainly because of the light/white fur areas.', '2006-12-18 15:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129107, 436648, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Further out, bigger (640) and better focus on the eyes and wider focal range, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Further out, bigger (640) and better focus on the eyes and wider focal range, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-18 15:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
