(3129352, 437752, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d crop this sucker in real tight on the face, or at least just the head. My eyes are so drawn to the tongue (and eyes), everything else seems a waste of space.</td>', 'I''d crop this sucker in real tight on the face, or at least just the head. My eyes are so drawn to the tongue (and eyes), everything else seems a waste of space.', '2006-12-18 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129358, 435696, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. Awesome title. Good choice to make sure the entire ear is in the frame, but it seems kind of lost.</td>', 'Cool picture. Awesome title. Good choice to make sure the entire ear is in the frame, but it seems kind of lost.', '2006-12-18 16:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129362, 437879, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m going with "intentional blur" as opposed to "out of focus," but the centered composition doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I''m going with "intentional blur" as opposed to "out of focus," but the centered composition doesn''t work for me.', '2006-12-18 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129373, 437637, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think the negative space overwhelms her. She''s getting lost in all that white, so I''m mostly seeing her outfit. I''m losing the tiara, too, which is a shame ''cause it''s a cute touch.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think the negative space overwhelms her. She''s getting lost in all that white, so I''m mostly seeing her outfit. I''m losing the tiara, too, which is a shame ''cause it''s a cute touch.', '2006-12-18 16:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129385, 436363, 208, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I''ll let other people complain about the wrinkles on the sheet (they don''t bother me much), but I wish there were more definition to the dog. The crop is good, but the lighting almost makes him look like a cardboard cutout instead of a real dog.</td>', 'Great capture! I''ll let other people complain about the wrinkles on the sheet (they don''t bother me much), but I wish there were more definition to the dog. The crop is good, but the lighting almost makes him look like a cardboard cutout instead of a real dog.', '2006-12-18 16:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129586, 436630, 56826, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dog.  I like the composition and lighting, I just wish I could see his eyes better...I wish they were lit a little more.  Nice job though.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous dog.  I like the composition and lighting, I just wish I could see his eyes better...I wish they were lit a little more.  Nice job though.  8', '2006-12-18 18:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129591, 437750, 56826, '<td valign="top">What an adorable, happy little dog!  You have captured the spirit of your subject beautifully.  Nicely done.</td>', 'What an adorable, happy little dog!  You have captured the spirit of your subject beautifully.  Nicely done.', '2006-12-18 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129593, 436503, 56826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the eyes really stand out nicely.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the eyes really stand out nicely.', '2006-12-18 18:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129599, 437991, 56826, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and beautiful dog.  <br/> <br/>I found the blurry grass in the front left corner to be distracting though.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and beautiful dog.   I found the blurry grass in the front left corner to be distracting though.', '2006-12-18 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129607, 435893, 69684, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination. Looks sharp and very nice model!</td>', 'Nice color combination. Looks sharp and very nice model!', '2006-12-18 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129609, 436126, 56826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog - I like the way her eyes stand out in this shot. Nice lighitng and composition.<br/> <br/>I''m undecided on the background though, I wonder if it is too similar in colour to her, making the image overall sort of flat.  Perhaps bumping the shadows and saturation would help to make her stand out more?</td>', 'Beautiful dog - I like the way her eyes stand out in this shot. Nice lighitng and composition. I''m undecided on the background though, I wonder if it is too similar in colour to her, making the image overall sort of flat.  Perhaps bumping the shadows and saturation would help to make her stand out more?', '2006-12-18 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129610, 435355, 69684, '<td valign="top">Beautiful combination! How did you get (and keep) them in this position?</td>', 'Beautiful combination! How did you get (and keep) them in this position?', '2006-12-18 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129613, 436888, 56826, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, very nice lighting.</td>', 'Excellent detail, very nice lighting.', '2006-12-18 18:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129617, 437811, 69684, '<td valign="top">very nice cat, but  the photo looks unsharp.</td>', 'very nice cat, but  the photo looks unsharp.', '2006-12-18 18:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3129841, 436234, 65324, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-12-18 20:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
