(3130706, 436963, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Dog is looking straight at camera it seems.  Just a little more clarity/sharper on the dog and softer on the surrounds, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Dog is looking straight at camera it seems.  Just a little more clarity/sharper on the dog and softer on the surrounds, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 07:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130707, 437981, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks like resizing issues primarily.  Variation in crop and framing, likely have helped this too in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks like resizing issues primarily.  Variation in crop and framing, likely have helped this too in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 07:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130708, 437007, 69826, '<td valign="top">A beautiful soft image. Maybe a LITTLE too dark, but that''s a minor point</td>', 'A beautiful soft image. Maybe a LITTLE too dark, but that''s a minor point', '2006-12-19 07:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130710, 437947, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Dog looking at or at least ''toward'' camera and the lighting much more subtle, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Dog looking at or at least ''toward'' camera and the lighting much more subtle, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 07:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130711, 437063, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Reflections in the eyes dominate more than the eyes do in my opinion.  Second thing my eye is drawn to is the ''wet'' mouth.  Bokeh is nice.</td>', '5 - Reflections in the eyes dominate more than the eyes do in my opinion.  Second thing my eye is drawn to is the ''wet'' mouth.  Bokeh is nice.', '2006-12-19 07:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130712, 437323, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not quite fitting the Challenge in my opinion, perhaps a good image elsewhere, but not for this Challenge.</td>', '2 - Not quite fitting the Challenge in my opinion, perhaps a good image elsewhere, but not for this Challenge.', '2006-12-19 07:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130714, 435912, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - ... Finnegan seems to be all tongue and yellow eyes.  Fixing the flash eyes and a variation in perspective would have helped this in my opinion.  As is, this image is .. a bit odd.</td>', '2 - ... Finnegan seems to be all tongue and yellow eyes.  Fixing the flash eyes and a variation in perspective would have helped this in my opinion.  As is, this image is .. a bit odd.', '2006-12-19 07:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130716, 436126, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice straight portrait - like to have seen a variation in lighting or using dof in a different way perhaps for more pop.  Sunlight looks like itis on her neck.. so perhaps the potential was there for a variation, who knows.</td>', '6 - Nice straight portrait - like to have seen a variation in lighting or using dof in a different way perhaps for more pop.  Sunlight looks like itis on her neck.. so perhaps the potential was there for a variation, who knows.', '2006-12-19 07:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130717, 436548, 69826, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how long it tokk to capture this image. Excellent</td>', 'I''d love to know how long it tokk to capture this image. Excellent', '2006-12-19 07:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130719, 436103, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Don''t mind the perspective or even the tight crop, but looks like resizing issues, plus the eyes are dirty and there is a bit of grain/noise and also not sure that this toning is working as well as a variation may have.</td>', '3 - Don''t mind the perspective or even the tight crop, but looks like resizing issues, plus the eyes are dirty and there is a bit of grain/noise and also not sure that this toning is working as well as a variation may have.', '2006-12-19 07:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130723, 437371, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - This is nice, but the ''sudden'' change from the fur to the ''black'', is a little odd on first glance.  Like to have seen Smokey just a little more facing camera.  Beautiful coat and eyes, like to have seen even more detail/texture there, especially at the point closest to the camera - which could be focal issues, not sure, as seems sharper on the far side of the face.  As he/she is looking ''out'' of frame, perhaps a more vertical crop/framing would have given this an edge.</td>', '7 - This is nice, but the ''sudden'' change from the fur to the ''black'', is a little odd on first glance.  Like to have seen Smokey just a little more facing camera.  Beautiful coat and eyes, like to have seen even more detail/texture there, especially at the point closest to the camera - which could be focal issues, not sure, as seems sharper on the far side of the face.  As he/she is looking ''out'' of frame, perhaps a more vertical crop/framing would have given this an edge.', '2006-12-19 07:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3130724, 438075, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - One of the first things I see is the dirty eye.. to me this shot is more about the tongue action than capturing a ''portrait'' of Chops.</td>', '3 - One of the first things I see is the dirty eye.. to me this shot is more about the tongue action than capturing a ''portrait'' of Chops.', '2006-12-19 07:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
