(3130922, 437064, 24073, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad photo, it is quite good for any other standard outside DP.  The problem is it really hits the mediocracy plane.  The spot focus too, may turn voters away.  The nose is out of focus, and then the body, both of which are distracting.  It is also heavy to one side with light, which in itself is ok I think, but half of the nose is lost, and then his right eye is also lost.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad photo, it is quite good for any other standard outside DP.  The problem is it really hits the mediocracy plane.  The spot focus too, may turn voters away.  The nose is out of focus, and then the body, both of which are distracting.  It is also heavy to one side with light, which in itself is ok I think, but half of the nose is lost, and then his right eye is also lost.', '2006-12-19 09:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
