(3130969, 436630, 24073, '<td valign="top">The competition is so high in this challenge that I feel this one didn''t make it out of that medium.  Dont get me wrong though the photo is a delight, and there isn''t know technical disadvantage on your part.  It just doesn''t have flare.  I hope this isn''t too critical, because the pup is beautiful.  Its just in this challenge you have Christmas costumes, props, expensive studio lights, and advanced editing.  All of it accumulates to leaving this in the middle somewhere.</td>', 'The competition is so high in this challenge that I feel this one didn''t make it out of that medium.  Dont get me wrong though the photo is a delight, and there isn''t know technical disadvantage on your part.  It just doesn''t have flare.  I hope this isn''t too critical, because the pup is beautiful.  Its just in this challenge you have Christmas costumes, props, expensive studio lights, and advanced editing.  All of it accumulates to leaving this in the middle somewhere.', '2006-12-19 09:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
