(3130981, 437583, 24073, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, and practical enough to inspire me to want to shoot pets all day.  However, the competition is high throughout the challenge.  Technically this photo is very well done, but with costumes, props, expensive studio equipment, and advanced editing this may get mixed up in the middle somewhere.  GL to you mate.</td>', 'Lovely image, and practical enough to inspire me to want to shoot pets all day.  However, the competition is high throughout the challenge.  Technically this photo is very well done, but with costumes, props, expensive studio equipment, and advanced editing this may get mixed up in the middle somewhere.  GL to you mate.', '2006-12-19 09:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
