(3130987, 436972, 24073, '<td valign="top">Cats eyes have always intrigued me, the wierd "knowing" that seems to exist in them. This is a great capture of that feeling.  GL&gt;</td>', 'Cats eyes have always intrigued me, the wierd "knowing" that seems to exist in them. This is a great capture of that feeling.  GL>', '2006-12-19 09:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
