(3131096, 436431, 24073, '<td valign="top">Most photos that are this busy, aren''t my favorite shots, however I think this is fabulous.  I think you did a great job starting with your color coordination, then lighting, and finally composition.  Fantastic image.  GL.</td>', 'Most photos that are this busy, aren''t my favorite shots, however I think this is fabulous.  I think you did a great job starting with your color coordination, then lighting, and finally composition.  Fantastic image.  GL.', '2006-12-19 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
