(3131383, 436528, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great title!  They DO defy <b>description</b>,...and...I might add...<b>training!</b>  As I am learning, <i>the disciplining of a toddler is like trying "to herd cats."</i>  Yeehaw!  :}</td>', 'Great title!  They DO defy description,...and...I might add...training!  As I am learning, the disciplining of a toddler is like trying "to herd cats."  Yeehaw!  :}', '2006-12-19 12:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
