(3131420, 437555, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet, but IMHO a little too soft focus &amp; noisy.  I like the effect of Smart Blur on the ribbon &amp; blanket, the face &amp; the hair lose their "specialness" this way.  Maybe try keeping the ribbon &amp; blanket the same while copying the dog to a new layer for additional focusing in the original.  Not possible for Basic Edit, but very do-able in Advanced!  I hope it''s great!  :)</td>', 'Sweet, but IMHO a little too soft focus & noisy.  I like the effect of Smart Blur on the ribbon & blanket, the face & the hair lose their "specialness" this way.  Maybe try keeping the ribbon & blanket the same while copying the dog to a new layer for additional focusing in the original.  Not possible for Basic Edit, but very do-able in Advanced!  I hope it''s great!  :)', '2006-12-19 12:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131422, 436446, 50034, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2006-12-19 12:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131427, 438019, 43936, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and clever picture! And clever cat too... I also like the antique-vintage looking couch, very aristocrat-like. Good luck!</td>', 'Gorgeous and clever picture! And clever cat too... I also like the antique-vintage looking couch, very aristocrat-like. Good luck!', '2006-12-19 12:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131428, 435443, 43936, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture in autumn colors! Truly classy!</td>', 'Wonderful picture in autumn colors! Truly classy!', '2006-12-19 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131430, 438080, 43936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and sensitive picture! Two cubs... so emotional!</td>', 'Beautiful and sensitive picture! Two cubs... so emotional!', '2006-12-19 12:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131433, 438040, 46570, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Love those eyes...10</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Love those eyes...10', '2006-12-19 12:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131495, 435663, 18219, '<td valign="top">a strange pet to have, but a great photo of it none the less.<br/>crisp and clear.<br/>great DOF.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'a strange pet to have, but a great photo of it none the less.crisp and clear.great DOF.Good luck.', '2006-12-19 13:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131558, 436234, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw are those veins? I had pet mice and I think later on in their lives when they became sick I could see their veins. I hope everything is alright.  Very adorable picture and good focus. A little bit of detail is lost in the face but I feel that overall it does not negatively impact the image.</td>', 'Aw are those veins? I had pet mice and I think later on in their lives when they became sick I could see their veins. I hope everything is alright.  Very adorable picture and good focus. A little bit of detail is lost in the face but I feel that overall it does not negatively impact the image.', '2006-12-19 13:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131559, 437007, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw, totally gorgeous.</td>', 'Aw, totally gorgeous.', '2006-12-19 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131561, 436924, 53316, '<td valign="top">DUDE. Evil looking cat. Really hillarious image.</td>', 'DUDE. Evil looking cat. Really hillarious image.', '2006-12-19 13:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131568, 436378, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh how absolutely adorable!!!  You captured so well how the front paws are so mobile compared to mice or guinea pigs... that is my favorite part of these cute little creatures.  Great photo technically and cute-ly. :-)</td>', 'Oh how absolutely adorable!!!  You captured so well how the front paws are so mobile compared to mice or guinea pigs... that is my favorite part of these cute little creatures.  Great photo technically and cute-ly. :-)', '2006-12-19 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131606, 437356, 67697, '<td valign="top">I liked the lighting used to highlight the bird''s colors.</td>', 'I liked the lighting used to highlight the bird''s colors.', '2006-12-19 13:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131628, 436804, 66727, '<td valign="top">I see a very neat "detail" but I can`t see the "portrait"...</td>', 'I see a very neat "detail" but I can`t see the "portrait"...', '2006-12-19 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131631, 437896, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Further out, less blur and a little more front on, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Further out, less blur and a little more front on, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131636, 436845, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Tighter crop at the fore, softer lighting and less distracting surrounds, make this better in my opinion.  Frame detracts.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Tighter crop at the fore, softer lighting and less distracting surrounds, make this better in my opinion.  Frame detracts.', '2006-12-19 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131645, 437948, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Without looking, vaguely recall ''Stanley'', don''t think this has the same quality that that image does, in my opinion.  Background color is nice, but like to have seen much more clarity/sharper on Stanley''s eyes/face and more depth between him and the background.</td>', '6 - Without looking, vaguely recall ''Stanley'', don''t think this has the same quality that that image does, in my opinion.  Background color is nice, but like to have seen much more clarity/sharper on Stanley''s eyes/face and more depth between him and the background.', '2006-12-19 14:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131651, 436220, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the setup/concept, like to have seen the dog ''pop'' a little more against the ''elements.  Some noise visible.</td>', '6 - Like the setup/concept, like to have seen the dog ''pop'' a little more against the ''elements.  Some noise visible.', '2006-12-19 14:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131659, 437760, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice crop and composition.  Wonder about a little more ear top left, so perhaps a slightly taller frame.  And, ''if only'' both eyes evenly lit, but fairly minor.</td>', '8 - Nice crop and composition.  Wonder about a little more ear top left, so perhaps a slightly taller frame.  And, ''if only'' both eyes evenly lit, but fairly minor.', '2006-12-19 14:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131664, 437787, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A little too close in my opinion for this Challenge.  Perhaps a variation in crop on the right as well, to allow Augusta to ''feature'' more, make this better for this Challenge, in my opinion.</td>', '3 - A little too close in my opinion for this Challenge.  Perhaps a variation in crop on the right as well, to allow Augusta to ''feature'' more, make this better for this Challenge, in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131666, 436013, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - The darker areas are difficult to discern, so perhaps a variation in lighting and/or angle/perspective may have given this extra.  Frame seems a bit thick for this image, but your call.</td>', '4 - The darker areas are difficult to discern, so perhaps a variation in lighting and/or angle/perspective may have given this extra.  Frame seems a bit thick for this image, but your call.', '2006-12-19 14:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131668, 437438, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential, like the setup.  Wish the dog was in good focus and sharper.</td>', '4 - Good potential, like the setup.  Wish the dog was in good focus and sharper.', '2006-12-19 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131671, 437573, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice composition - sharper/more clarity on the eyes/face/fur and the whites in the hat with more detail, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Nice composition - sharper/more clarity on the eyes/face/fur and the whites in the hat with more detail, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131672, 437723, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice, but wonder about a variation in the framing, perhaps a little more height/square frame and the cat more strategically placed within it.  Also, a much sharper perspective/angle may have allowed the cat to be more dominant and given this a little extra.</td>', '5 - Nice, but wonder about a variation in the framing, perhaps a little more height/square frame and the cat more strategically placed within it.  Also, a much sharper perspective/angle may have allowed the cat to be more dominant and given this a little extra.', '2006-12-19 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131674, 437907, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Possibly good potential.  Removing the label, the collar not cropped, sharper, flash/lighting fixed and the title typo fixed, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Possibly good potential.  Removing the label, the collar not cropped, sharper, flash/lighting fixed and the title typo fixed, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131678, 438070, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the potential.  Nice pose.  Like the angle, although both eyes more visible likely better - but then you might lose the ''wispy fur''.  Mainly the focus and/or slight blur and a little too much empty space in my opinion.  Variation in framing/crop likely have given this an edge as well.</td>', '4 - Like the potential.  Nice pose.  Like the angle, although both eyes more visible likely better - but then you might lose the ''wispy fur''.  Mainly the focus and/or slight blur and a little too much empty space in my opinion.  Variation in framing/crop likely have given this an edge as well.', '2006-12-19 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131681, 437848, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice pose and clarity in the eyes.  Perhaps a little more width in the framing for visual balance may have given this an edge.  Toning works well but a little more ''depth'' / contrast (difficult with the coloring) may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Slightly tighter crop at the bottom too.</td>', '6 - Nice pose and clarity in the eyes.  Perhaps a little more width in the framing for visual balance may have given this an edge.  Toning works well but a little more ''depth'' / contrast (difficult with the coloring) may also have made this even better in my opinion.  Slightly tighter crop at the bottom too.', '2006-12-19 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131682, 437417, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Way too close in my opinion and focus is also off.  Perhaps a little more context and using what looks like good natural lighting more, may have also made this better.</td>', '3 - Way too close in my opinion and focus is also off.  Perhaps a little more context and using what looks like good natural lighting more, may have also made this better.', '2006-12-19 14:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131684, 437976, 61222, '<td valign="top">Pretty green eyes but lighting could be better</td>', 'Pretty green eyes but lighting could be better', '2006-12-19 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131685, 436874, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice pose/capture, but looks like it needs a nudge rotate up on the right, flash eyes fixed, softer overall lighting and sharper focus.  The sofa dominates the image too much in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice pose/capture, but looks like it needs a nudge rotate up on the right, flash eyes fixed, softer overall lighting and sharper focus.  The sofa dominates the image too much in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131689, 437765, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Not sure the frame color choice is enhancing this image, coupled with what appears to be a yellow tint overall, against a pale background, accentuates that.  Variation in composition and crop and, as they are both in shot, both in focus as well, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Not sure the frame color choice is enhancing this image, coupled with what appears to be a yellow tint overall, against a pale background, accentuates that.  Variation in composition and crop and, as they are both in shot, both in focus as well, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131692, 437948, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great shot love the colors :-)</td>', 'Great shot love the colors :-)', '2006-12-19 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131694, 437215, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Wish this were mainly about the dog and the dog''s right eye as well lit as the left.  Sharper too with the contrast/something a little more subtle, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Wish this were mainly about the dog and the dog''s right eye as well lit as the left.  Sharper too with the contrast/something a little more subtle, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131695, 436528, 61222, '<td valign="top">Very sharp love the clarity of this. Would like it better if cat was looking up. But we all know cats have minds of there own :-)</td>', 'Very sharp love the clarity of this. Would like it better if cat was looking up. But we all know cats have minds of there own :-)', '2006-12-19 14:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131696, 435986, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the composition and crop.  Not sure whether it is resizing issues or blur, but this sharper and more even lighting on the face, make it better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Like the composition and crop.  Not sure whether it is resizing issues or blur, but this sharper and more even lighting on the face, make it better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131697, 437356, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Lighting is nice, but a variation in angle to show the bird more, possibly the tail not cropped as well and, this 640, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Lighting is nice, but a variation in angle to show the bird more, possibly the tail not cropped as well and, this 640, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131701, 436543, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice - just wish the fabric had no stray hairs and was more subtle, along with the toy, allowing Juliet to dominate the image more.</td>', '7 - Nice - just wish the fabric had no stray hairs and was more subtle, along with the toy, allowing Juliet to dominate the image more.', '2006-12-19 14:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131705, 437494, 61222, '<td valign="top">Good image of the cat, but did not care for the red.</td>', 'Good image of the cat, but did not care for the red.', '2006-12-19 14:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131707, 436011, 61222, '<td valign="top">Really like the soft effect of this.:-)</td>', 'Really like the soft effect of this.:-)', '2006-12-19 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131708, 437814, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice scene with the lavender and outdoors.  Wish Olza was sharper and the flea collar(?) either removed for shot or the angle different to minimize it.  A little more height in frame may have also given this extra in my opinion.  The purple of the lavender is nice and perhaps potential there to ''use'' it more, but the similar brown tone middle left background, does help accentuate Olza''s eyes, so perhaps using that more may have also given this extra.</td>', '6 - Nice scene with the lavender and outdoors.  Wish Olza was sharper and the flea collar(?) either removed for shot or the angle different to minimize it.  A little more height in frame may have also given this extra in my opinion.  The purple of the lavender is nice and perhaps potential there to ''use'' it more, but the similar brown tone middle left background, does help accentuate Olza''s eyes, so perhaps using that more may have also given this extra.', '2006-12-19 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131717, 437678, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Despite the eyes closed, like the effect here, although perhaps a little more subtle to allow more detail to come through in Digit, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also, not so tightly cropped (especially bottom right), as well as perhaps a litlte more height at the top for added compositional balance, not sure.  Overall has a nice feel to it, just the aforementioned issues.</td>', '6 - Despite the eyes closed, like the effect here, although perhaps a little more subtle to allow more detail to come through in Digit, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also, not so tightly cropped (especially bottom right), as well as perhaps a litlte more height at the top for added compositional balance, not sure.  Overall has a nice feel to it, just the aforementioned issues.', '2006-12-19 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131719, 437082, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great candid action shot. These are my favorite kind of images.</td>', 'Great candid action shot. These are my favorite kind of images.', '2006-12-19 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131728, 437456, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice, toning works well, nice composition and crop.  Fairly minor, but the few ''blown'' areas.  Like to have discerned a little more detail, despite the softness.</td>', '8 - Nice, toning works well, nice composition and crop.  Fairly minor, but the few ''blown'' areas.  Like to have discerned a little more detail, despite the softness.', '2006-12-19 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
