(3131739, 438012, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Difficult, but even sharper on the eyes and more even lighting, perhaps a little more space above the head too, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Difficult, but even sharper on the eyes and more even lighting, perhaps a little more space above the head too, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-12-19 14:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3131741, 438032, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this, lighting is nice, just wonder about a variation in framing to bring the eye/facial profile more dominant within the image.  Like to have seen the eye even sharper too.  Undecided on the cropped ear.</td>', '6 - Like this, lighting is nice, just wonder about a variation in framing to bring the eye/facial profile more dominant within the image.  Like to have seen the eye even sharper too.  Undecided on the cropped ear.', '2006-12-19 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
