(3134163, 438118, 68504, '<td valign="top">Hmn.  Thought this would have done better.  Maybe because of the Santa hat which is why I almost didn''t click on it myself, but hat''s textures blend well with other textures, and picture has a great unity.</td>', 'Hmn.  Thought this would have done better.  Maybe because of the Santa hat which is why I almost didn''t click on it myself, but hat''s textures blend well with other textures, and picture has a great unity.', '2006-12-20 03:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3134184, 437858, 68887, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blue Moon:</b></div><hr/><i> not sure what the two bars are, but the really take away from the image </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>those two bars where the support of a alogen lamp. i know they are a little bit distracting, but what i was to communicate was a sensation of intimity, a sort of spontaneous situation.. the truth is that i''ve tryied to remake this photography:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.deviantart.com/deviation/44948404/?qo=5&amp;q=by%3Ash0ggy&amp;qh=sort%3Atime+-in%3Ascraps" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Real Pearl</a> <br/> <br/>that i''ve made just 2 days before the opening of the contest :( i think the original one have and intensity and color wonderful so i''ve tryied to recreate it but it hasn''t worked :(<br/> <br/>i would very appreciate the comment on the original one by the people who didn''t like the remake.. what do you think about it?<br/> <br/>p.s.: this was my first partecipation to a photo challenge in all my life(in fact i''ve got my reflex less than a months..)! thanks for everyone who give my high votes and who has posted comments.. i really need them!<br/> <br/>bye</td>', 'Originally posted by Blue Moon: not sure what the two bars are, but the really take away from the image   those two bars where the support of a alogen lamp. i know they are a little bit distracting, but what i was to communicate was a sensation of intimity, a sort of spontaneous situation.. the truth is that i''ve tryied to remake this photography: Real Pearl  that i''ve made just 2 days before the opening of the contest :( i think the original one have and intensity and color wonderful so i''ve tryied to recreate it but it hasn''t worked :( i would very appreciate the comment on the original one by the people who didn''t like the remake.. what do you think about it? p.s.: this was my first partecipation to a photo challenge in all my life(in fact i''ve got my reflex less than a months..)! thanks for everyone who give my high votes and who has posted comments.. i really need them! bye', '2006-12-20 03:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
