(3135086, 437570, 50695, '<td valign="top">I wonder if kelbelle and I were the only ones to get your joke? It''s brilliant. You are a comedy genius, doomed to be misunderstood by DPC.</td>', 'I wonder if kelbelle and I were the only ones to get your joke? It''s brilliant. You are a comedy genius, doomed to be misunderstood by DPC.', '2006-12-20 10:02:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135118, 437745, 59029, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for comments during the challenge.  I knew of course that a portrait traditionally shows just the face, but shooting equids (ie horses, ponies, donkeys) is tricky as they have such long faces.  Also taking into account that these beasties tend to ''talk'' with their whole bodies, not just their faces,  is why I chose to shoot as I did.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for comments during the challenge.  I knew of course that a portrait traditionally shows just the face, but shooting equids (ie horses, ponies, donkeys) is tricky as they have such long faces.  Also taking into account that these beasties tend to ''talk'' with their whole bodies, not just their faces,  is why I chose to shoot as I did.', '2006-12-20 10:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135140, 437570, 15305, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC!!!!  This is a tough crowd, so don''t be let down. Keep it up!!<br/> <br/>I''m looking forward to your next entry.<br/></td>', 'Welcome to DPC!!!!  This is a tough crowd, so don''t be let down. Keep it up!! I''m looking forward to your next entry.', '2006-12-20 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135152, 437572, 48954, '<td valign="top">Hey Yanko,<br/> <br/>One thing i have learned on this site is that prediction is NO GOOD! I never predicted my "original sin" shot to win. I thought it was boring and it only took me 45min to take, whereas my "Poison" shot took me 5 hours and was, in my humble opinion, "ground breaking" cause there hadn''t been a shot done like that before...i think. Original Sin got 2nd and Poison got 16th. Bleh. Not that im complaining about my 2place but still.<br/> <br/>Anyways, i''m actully looking at your pic to congratulate you on your ribbon and not to give you advice. Good work. Great shot.<br/> <br/>Chris<br/> <br/>ps: sorry for not submitting anything in the last week but this week i got one challenge submission done so don''t worry ;)</td>', 'Hey Yanko, One thing i have learned on this site is that prediction is NO GOOD! I never predicted my "original sin" shot to win. I thought it was boring and it only took me 45min to take, whereas my "Poison" shot took me 5 hours and was, in my humble opinion, "ground breaking" cause there hadn''t been a shot done like that before...i think. Original Sin got 2nd and Poison got 16th. Bleh. Not that im complaining about my 2place but still. Anyways, i''m actully looking at your pic to congratulate you on your ribbon and not to give you advice. Good work. Great shot. Chris ps: sorry for not submitting anything in the last week but this week i got one challenge submission done so don''t worry ;)', '2006-12-20 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135169, 437572, 37961, '<td valign="top">Congrats yanko...you nailed the essence of your cat with this portrait...Marvelous!</td>', 'Congrats yanko...you nailed the essence of your cat with this portrait...Marvelous!', '2006-12-20 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135201, 437613, 66597, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favs of challenge. It''s an example of selective desat really working. You have a very strong composition going with the two eyes and nose forming a triange that draws viewer''s eyes to center. Very strong photo. Congrats!</td>', 'This was one of my favs of challenge. It''s an example of selective desat really working. You have a very strong composition going with the two eyes and nose forming a triange that draws viewer''s eyes to center. Very strong photo. Congrats!', '2006-12-20 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135205, 437497, 66597, '<td valign="top">The expression on your cat''s face is great. I think the lighting (would like to see the face a touch brighter) and busy background hurt you on this one. Since it was advanced, you might have cloned the small dark strip on right-hand side for a higher score.</td>', 'The expression on your cat''s face is great. I think the lighting (would like to see the face a touch brighter) and busy background hurt you on this one. Since it was advanced, you might have cloned the small dark strip on right-hand side for a higher score.', '2006-12-20 10:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135209, 437260, 66597, '<td valign="top">What beautiful sharp focus you have in this photo! Great expression and very nice composition. The only thing I''d change is just a little more "breathing room" around the tops of the ears. Great job and look at that high score!</td>', 'What beautiful sharp focus you have in this photo! Great expression and very nice composition. The only thing I''d change is just a little more "breathing room" around the tops of the ears. Great job and look at that high score!', '2006-12-20 10:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135210, 437801, 66597, '<td valign="top">I found this photo so sweet it almost made me cry. The nostalgia in the expression is very well captured, and the composition is great. Way to go on that 5.9 - great score for a great photo!</td>', 'I found this photo so sweet it almost made me cry. The nostalgia in the expression is very well captured, and the composition is great. Way to go on that 5.9 - great score for a great photo!', '2006-12-20 10:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135213, 436864, 66597, '<td valign="top">This was compositionally one of my favorites of challenge. Had it been a touch sharper and the background a touch less busy, I would have given it a 10. Your creativity really shines here. Great job!</td>', 'This was compositionally one of my favorites of challenge. Had it been a touch sharper and the background a touch less busy, I would have given it a 10. Your creativity really shines here. Great job!', '2006-12-20 10:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135214, 438100, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am just furious at the voters.  I gave this a 10.  I think it is excellent.  Grrrrrr</td>', 'I am just furious at the voters.  I gave this a 10.  I think it is excellent.  Grrrrrr', '2006-12-20 10:40:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135218, 437813, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and expression, but the color seems really off. Did you change the hue or up the saturation a lot? I also think the highlights toward back are distracting. Very cute doggie, though! Bet your grandmother will treasure this!</td>', 'I like the pose and expression, but the color seems really off. Did you change the hue or up the saturation a lot? I also think the highlights toward back are distracting. Very cute doggie, though! Bet your grandmother will treasure this!', '2006-12-20 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135229, 435625, 66597, '<td valign="top">Chris,<br/>Obviously, a great photo. The soft focus and DOF are perfect. I''m not sure about the background - find the details a touch distracting - but the earthy tone is perfect to "warm" the gray dog. Congrats on that 6th place!</td>', 'Chris,Obviously, a great photo. The soft focus and DOF are perfect. I''m not sure about the background - find the details a touch distracting - but the earthy tone is perfect to "warm" the gray dog. Congrats on that 6th place!', '2006-12-20 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135240, 437348, 66597, '<td valign="top">This little guy is so cute! I love his expression. I think what hurt you in this challenge was the bright area in front right more than anything - draws the eye away from Chilli.</td>', 'This little guy is so cute! I love his expression. I think what hurt you in this challenge was the bright area in front right more than anything - draws the eye away from Chilli.', '2006-12-20 10:47:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135246, 437745, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love that you brought donkeys to what was essentially a "dog and cat" show! They are very cute and obviously great pals. Unfortunately, the photo is a bit dark and not quite in focus. A bit of dodging on the donkeys'' faces might help bring them out a bit more?</td>', 'I love that you brought donkeys to what was essentially a "dog and cat" show! They are very cute and obviously great pals. Unfortunately, the photo is a bit dark and not quite in focus. A bit of dodging on the donkeys'' faces might help bring them out a bit more?', '2006-12-20 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135248, 437233, 33535, '<td valign="top">52th??? this was one of my favorites in the challenge, i love everything about that photo and gave it a ten.</td>', '52th??? this was one of my favorites in the challenge, i love everything about that photo and gave it a ten.', '2006-12-20 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135258, 437879, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don,<br/>I gave this one a 6. I think it''s a great capture - love that you caught Knuckles mid-yawn. It is also pretty sharp for not being quite in focus. Maybe a higher ISO would have helped "freeze" the motion better, though of course I realize that also results in a grainy look. Tough to photo animals indoors while moving! I love kitties and Knuckles is adorable.</td>', 'Don,I gave this one a 6. I think it''s a great capture - love that you caught Knuckles mid-yawn. It is also pretty sharp for not being quite in focus. Maybe a higher ISO would have helped "freeze" the motion better, though of course I realize that also results in a grainy look. Tough to photo animals indoors while moving! I love kitties and Knuckles is adorable.', '2006-12-20 10:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135264, 435355, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot Linda. I agree with Shez here, this would make a fantastic print. Congrats on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Great shot Linda. I agree with Shez here, this would make a fantastic print. Congrats on your top 20 finish.', '2006-12-20 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135265, 437976, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - I find the juxtaposition of the green eye and swath of green in the background interesting. I do think it would have scored better if the whole background more or less matched the eye. Harley is adorable. I love kitties!</td>', 'I really like this shot - I find the juxtaposition of the green eye and swath of green in the background interesting. I do think it would have scored better if the whole background more or less matched the eye. Harley is adorable. I love kitties!', '2006-12-20 10:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135276, 436869, 41794, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge - <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for all the great comments. I can confirm that yes - this snake is my pet. One of 17 snakes now that I currently own. She is a charcoal cornsnake. And you think cats are hard to get posed...try a snake. They don''t have ears so you can call them and get them to look at you...LOL!<br/>This girl is still a baby, although a little bit bigger than most of my other baby cornsnakes so one of the easier ones to photograph. I too wish the focus on her head was a little tighter, but c''est la vie. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Post Challenge -  Thanks everyone for all the great comments. I can confirm that yes - this snake is my pet. One of 17 snakes now that I currently own. She is a charcoal cornsnake. And you think cats are hard to get posed...try a snake. They don''t have ears so you can call them and get them to look at you...LOL!This girl is still a baby, although a little bit bigger than most of my other baby cornsnakes so one of the easier ones to photograph. I too wish the focus on her head was a little tighter, but c''est la vie.  ', '2006-12-20 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135314, 436959, 34659, '<td valign="top">Aw - how cute!  Love the processing on this.  I scored it an 8 during voting.  Great softness &amp; clarity (yes, I realize that''s an oxymoron, but it''s true!).</td>', 'Aw - how cute!  Love the processing on this.  I scored it an 8 during voting.  Great softness & clarity (yes, I realize that''s an oxymoron, but it''s true!).', '2006-12-20 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
