(3135529, 436946, 66952, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your votes, everyone. This is my best finish so far, and I''m really pleased. The first shot I took (with the date set to 2005) had a better expression on the dog''s face, and the arrangement of the lights looked more natural, but this is the best one I could get once I had the date set right. And I had a problem (since fixed) with pictures uploaded to DPC being much darker than what I see on my monitor. So, considering those things, I think 22nd is great!<br/> <br/>This is definitely going to be my Christmas card next year!</td>', 'Thanks for your votes, everyone. This is my best finish so far, and I''m really pleased. The first shot I took (with the date set to 2005) had a better expression on the dog''s face, and the arrangement of the lights looked more natural, but this is the best one I could get once I had the date set right. And I had a problem (since fixed) with pictures uploaded to DPC being much darker than what I see on my monitor. So, considering those things, I think 22nd is great! This is definitely going to be my Christmas card next year!', '2006-12-20 12:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135540, 437698, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awww, I scored this above average, Tate.  <br/>It reminded me when I saw it first, and<br/>again, when I see it now, of a Japanese<br/>woodblock painting because of Mamü''s pose<br/>and coloring.</td>', 'Awww, I scored this above average, Tate.  It reminded me when I saw it first, andagain, when I see it now, of a Japanesewoodblock painting because of Mamü''s poseand coloring.', '2006-12-20 12:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135549, 436986, 2382, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on hitting the top 10!  In my opinion, dogs should have been given equal standing and this guy should have been in the top 3!  :-D   Kidding aside, this was one of my 10''s and I thought it was a perfect capture of a beautiful animal!  Way to go!</td>', 'Congratulations on hitting the top 10!  In my opinion, dogs should have been given equal standing and this guy should have been in the top 3!  :-D   Kidding aside, this was one of my 10''s and I thought it was a perfect capture of a beautiful animal!  Way to go!', '2006-12-20 12:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135607, 437173, 63269, '<td valign="top">This definetely deserved much better...</td>', 'This definetely deserved much better...', '2006-12-20 12:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3135630, 436323, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congradulations on your personal best, my little E-bug! You remained persistent and very patient to get the shot they way you wanted even though it took 45 minutes &amp; Eclair was not sitting still. I am very proud of how you handled yourself.</td>', 'Congradulations on your personal best, my little E-bug! You remained persistent and very patient to get the shot they way you wanted even though it took 45 minutes & Eclair was not sitting still. I am very proud of how you handled yourself.', '2006-12-20 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
