(3136394, 437245, 56797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cryingdragon:</b></div><hr/><i> Now that is one crazy look on that cat.  Any more catnip and I bet she''d have a heart attack. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>awwww. no heart attack for my wittle baby!! no!!!..lol there was no catnip actually involved. just playing with a cotton ball(which I never let her actually keep or eat). Ive never seen her make this face before. I actually didnt even notice it while shooting.</td>', 'Originally posted by cryingdragon: Now that is one crazy look on that cat.  Any more catnip and I bet she''d have a heart attack.   awwww. no heart attack for my wittle baby!! no!!!..lol there was no catnip actually involved. just playing with a cotton ball(which I never let her actually keep or eat). Ive never seen her make this face before. I actually didnt even notice it while shooting.', '2006-12-20 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
