(3136401, 438084, 68279, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.<br/> <br/>Yes this is actually my pet.  I originally got into saltwater tanks so that I could have an octo tank.<br/> <br/>I''m having a lot of issues with pics showing up darker because I can''t get the brightview display on my laptop to mimic a regular monitor.  Pretty much hoses any processing.  Hopefully I can get a new monitor that I can calibrate a bit better after x-mas.  Congrats to the winners.  There were simply tons of amazing shots in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Brian</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone. Yes this is actually my pet.  I originally got into saltwater tanks so that I could have an octo tank. I''m having a lot of issues with pics showing up darker because I can''t get the brightview display on my laptop to mimic a regular monitor.  Pretty much hoses any processing.  Hopefully I can get a new monitor that I can calibrate a bit better after x-mas.  Congrats to the winners.  There were simply tons of amazing shots in this challenge. Brian', '2006-12-20 16:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
