(3159092, 436011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - love the story that goes with it.  A gorgeous shot of a gorgeous animal.  Perfectly placed within the frame, in my opinion. And in a way, it could be almost two dogs - the different "look" created by both the different eyes and the way the light highlights the face.  Very cool!</td>', 'Heh - love the story that goes with it.  A gorgeous shot of a gorgeous animal.  Perfectly placed within the frame, in my opinion. And in a way, it could be almost two dogs - the different "look" created by both the different eyes and the way the light highlights the face.  Very cool!', '2006-12-29 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
