(3159892, 437260, 50641, '<td valign="top">Adorable and so expressive (or rather, inexpressive in a deliberate-seeming way) - perfect title!  7 from me.  Missy looks a lot like our new kitty, Knuckles.  I have a hunch she would look really nifty against a dark background given all those nice colors in her fur.  Looking forward to seeing her again :)</td>', 'Adorable and so expressive (or rather, inexpressive in a deliberate-seeming way) - perfect title!  7 from me.  Missy looks a lot like our new kitty, Knuckles.  I have a hunch she would look really nifty against a dark background given all those nice colors in her fur.  Looking forward to seeing her again :)', '2006-12-29 14:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160267, 436035, 5885, '<td valign="top">A like the shot a lot. But would make a few changes.<br/> <br/>I would crop the post to the right of the image, first off. It''s a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>As far as the B&amp;W conversion goes, it is a bit flat. In levels or curves adjustments, you can jack up your whites and blacks a bit and will see a major improvement in the look of the shot.</td>', 'A like the shot a lot. But would make a few changes. I would crop the post to the right of the image, first off. It''s a bit distracting. As far as the B&W conversion goes, it is a bit flat. In levels or curves adjustments, you can jack up your whites and blacks a bit and will see a major improvement in the look of the shot.', '2006-12-29 16:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
