(3202898, 438017, 12268, '<td valign="top">DAMN! What a shot! What a capture! Congrats on a superb shot! This shot really shows what YOU can do with the 400D! Absolutely superb sharpness and composition. Mesmerizing shot! Well done! The colours, the capture, all awe-inspiring.<br/>Peace<br/>Rooster</td>', 'DAMN! What a shot! What a capture! Congrats on a superb shot! This shot really shows what YOU can do with the 400D! Absolutely superb sharpness and composition. Mesmerizing shot! Well done! The colours, the capture, all awe-inspiring.PeaceRooster', '2007-01-10 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 0),
