(3465218, 436821, 48765, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alanna:</b></div><hr/><i> why would you dress any animal up to make it more human?? animals are not human and should not be treated or seen as having human characteristics.  Besides what does being a fireman have to do with this dog? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just like to point out... I don''t dress this dog to make her more human... she has no undercoat and is always cold... she NEEDS to be dressed.  The dog and the fireman question can be answered in the title of this picture... Dalmations seem to be the ''mascot'' of fire departments, it''s meant to be a joke... of course this little dog can''t ride along on a fire truck!</td>', 'Originally posted by Alanna: why would you dress any animal up to make it more human?? animals are not human and should not be treated or seen as having human characteristics.  Besides what does being a fireman have to do with this dog?   Just like to point out... I don''t dress this dog to make her more human... she has no undercoat and is always cold... she NEEDS to be dressed.  The dog and the fireman question can be answered in the title of this picture... Dalmations seem to be the ''mascot'' of fire departments, it''s meant to be a joke... of course this little dog can''t ride along on a fire truck!', '2007-03-15 20:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
